                         (s0 (optionOr (findSess ss sid) (newSess sid)))\n                                  (mtime (mt (fileStat full) ((ok st) st.mtime) ((err _) 0)))]\n                              (ok (putSess ss (Sess :id sid :mode j.mode :owns j.owns :turns j.turns :result j.result\n                                                    :staged s0.staged :at (max s0.at mtime) :ago 0 :status \"\")))))))))))\n              (ok (list)) names))))\n\nfn storeSessions! store: String ss0: (List Sess) -> (Result (List Sess) String)\n  (mt (dirList store)\n    ((err e) (err (str (errClass e) \": \" e)))\n    ((ok names)\n      (fold (fn [(acc (Result (List Sess) String)) (sid String)] -> (Result (List Sess) String)\n              (mt acc\n                ((err e) (err e))\n                ((ok ss)\n                  (let [(full (c/joinPath store sid))]\n                    (if (or (not (c/isDir? full)) (not (sessionId? sid)))\n                      (ok ss)\n                      (mt (stagedPaths! full)\n                        ((err e) (err e))\n                        ((ok sp)\n                          (let [(paths (listSort (pairFirst sp)))]\n                            (if (and (listEmpty? paths) (none? (findSess ss sid)))\n                              (ok ss)\n                              (let [(s0 (optionOr (findSess ss sid) (newSess sid)))]\n                                (ok (putSess ss (Sess :id sid :mode s0.mode :owns s0.owns :turns s0.turns :result s0.result\n                                                      :staged paths :at (max s0.at (pairSecond sp)) :ago 0 :status \"\")))))))))))))\n            (ok ss0) names)))\n\nfn withStatus now: Int64 s: Sess -> Sess\n  (let [(ago (max 0 (- now s.at)))\n        (status (cond ((some? s.result) \"finished\") ((< ago (staleAfter)) \"running\") (else \"stale\")))]\n    (with s :ago ago :status status))\n\nfn porcelainPaths recs: (List String) acc: (List String) -> (List String)\n  (mt (listHead recs)\n    ((none) (listReverse acc))\n    ((some rec)\n      (let [(rest (optionOr (listTail recs) (list)))]\n        (if (< (stringLength rec) 4)\n          (porcelainPaths rest acc)\n          (let [(acc2 (cons (sliceOf rec 3 (stringLength rec)) acc)) (x (sliceOf rec 0 1))]\n            (porcelainPaths (if (or (= x \"R\") (= x \"C\")) (optionOr (listTail rest) (list)) rest) acc2))))))\n\nfn overlapForms running: (List Sess) -> (List String)\n  (mt (listHead running)\n    ((none) (list))\n    ((some a)\n      (let [(rest (optionOr (listTail running) (list)))]\n        (listAppend\n          (fold (fn [(acc (List String)) (b Sess)] -> (List String)\n                  (let [(on (ownsMeet a.owns b.owns))]\n                    (if (listEmpty? on) acc (listAppend acc (list (str \"(:a \" (c/quoted a.id) \" :b \" (c/quoted b.id) \" :on \" (pathList on) \")\"))))))\n                (list) rest)\n          (overlapForms rest)))))\n\nfn sessForm dirty: (List String) s: Sess -> String\n  (let [(mine (listSort (filter (fn [(p String)] -> Bool (listAny? (fn [(o String)] -> Bool (ownsCover? o p)) s.owns)) dirty)))]\n    (str \"(:id \" (c/quoted s.id) \" :mode :\" s.mode \" :owns \" (pathList s.owns) \" :staged \" (pathList s.staged)\n         \" :dirty \" (pathList mine) \" :turns \" s.turns \" :lastTurnAgo \" (stringFromInt64 s.ago)\n         \" :status :\" s.status \" :result \" (mt s.result ((some r) (str \":\" r)) ((none) \"none\")) \")\"))\n\nfn countStatus ss: (List Sess) st: String -> Int64\n  (listLength (filter (fn [(s Sess)] -> Bool (= s.status st)) ss))\n\nfn fitSessions head: String forms: (List String) shown: Int64 -> (Result String String)\n  (let [(receipt (str head \" :sessions (\" (c/joinWith (listTake forms shown) \" \") \") :more \" (stringFromInt64 (- (listLength forms) shown)) \")\"))]\n    (cond\n      ((< (c/byteLen receipt) (c/receiptMax)) (ok receipt))\n      ((= shown 0) (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_RECEIPT_TOO_LARGE\" (str \"session receipt exceeds \" (stringFromInt64 (c/receiptMax)) \" bytes with no session shown\") \"\")))\n      (else (fitSessions head forms (- shown 1)))))\n\nfn dirtyPaths! root: String owns: (List String) ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result (List String) String)\n  (if (listEmpty? owns)\n    (ok (list))\n    (mt (c/git! (listAppend (list \"status\" \"--porcelain\" \"-z\" \"--untracked-files=all\" \"--\") owns) root ctx)\n      ((err e) (err e))\n      ((ok p) (if (!= (pairFirst p) 0)\n                (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_GIT\" (str \"git status failed in \" root) \"\"))\n                (ok (porcelainPaths (c/splitByte (pairSecond p) 0) (list)))))))\n\nfn ! observeSession! root: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (mt (journalSessions! (c/joinPath root \".asl/run/agentLoop\"))\n    ((err e) (err e))\n    ((ok js)\n      (mt (mt (vfsRoot! root ctx) ((some store) (storeSessions! store js)) ((none) (ok js)))\n        ((err e) (err e))\n        ((ok ss)\n          (let [(stated (map (fn [(s Sess)] -> Sess (withStatus ctx.now s)) ss))\n                (ordered (listSortBy (fn [(s Sess)] -> Int64 (- 0 s.at)) (listSortBy (fn [(s Sess)] -> String s.id) stated)))\n                (ownsAll (c/sortUnique (fold (fn [(acc (List String)) (s Sess)] -> (List String) (listAppend acc s.owns)) (list) ordered)))]\n            (mt (dirtyPaths! root ownsAll ctx)\n              ((err e) (err e))\n              ((ok dirty)\n                (mt (c/shortRev! root ctx)\n                  ((err e) (err e))\n                  ((ok rev)\n                    (let [(running (filter (fn [(s Sess)] -> Bool (= s.status \"running\")) ordered))\n                          (own (optionOr (c/ctxEnv ctx \"ASL_SESSION\") \"\"))\n                          (head (str \"(:observe :dim session :v 1 :rev \" rev \" :staleAfter \" (stringFromInt64 (staleAfter))\n                                     (if (stringEmpty? own) \"\" (str \" :self \" (c/quoted own)))\n                                     \" :count (:running \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength running))\n                                     \" :finished \" (stringFromInt64 (countStatus ordered \"finished\"))\n                                     \" :stale \" (stringFromInt64 (countStatus ordered \"stale\")) \")\"\n                                     \" :overlaps (\" (c/joinWith (overlapForms running) \" \") \")\"))\n                          (forms (map (fn [(s Sess)] -> String (sessForm dirty s)) ordered))]\n                      (fitSessions head forms (min limit (listLength ordered)))))))))))))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/callers.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/callers\n  :x [observeCallers! textMentions! absentLine setOf padLine]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/hmap :a h)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/aslIndex :a ai)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyDump :a d)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyIndex :a p)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyQuery :a q)])\n\nfn callersLimits -> String\n  (str \"python: static ast resolution over this workspace; a call through an untyped receiver, a stored \"\n       \"function value or a dynamic getattr name is :possible; asl: (alias/name ...) through the module \"\n       \":i/:import aliases and same-module (name ...) heads; asl graph answers the asex graph, not this workspace\")\n\nfn textExt -> (List String)\n  (list \".md\" \".txt\" \".rst\" \".asn\" \".toml\" \".cfg\" \".ini\" \".yaml\" \".yml\" \".json\")\n\nfn textMaxBytes -> Int64\n  1048576\n\nfn rankOf why: String -> Int64\n  (cond ((= why \"otherDefinition\") 0) ((= why \"importOnly\") 1) ((= why \"docstring\") 2) ((= why \"string\") 3) ((= why \"comment\") 4) ((= why \"similarName\") 5) (else 6))\n\nfn keyOf rel: String line: Int64 -> String\n  (str rel \"\\x00\" (stringFromInt64 line))\n\nfn putFound found: (h/HMap ai/Mention) accounted: (h/HMap Bool) m: ai/Mention -> (h/HMap ai/Mention)\n  (let [(k (keyOf m.rel m.line))]\n    (if (h/hmHas? accounted k)\n      found\n      (mt (h/hmGet found k)\n        ((none) (h/hmPut found k m))\n        ((some cur) (if (< (rankOf m.why) (rankOf cur.why)) (h/hmPut found k m) found)))))\n\nfn proseLines rel: String text: String sym: String -> (List ai/Mention)\n  (let [(ls (c/keepEndsLines (c/universalNewlines text)))]\n    (fold (fn [(acc (List ai/Mention)) (p (Pair Int64 String))] -> (List ai/Mention)\n            (if (stringContains? (pairSecond p) sym) (cons (ai/Mention :rel rel :line (+ (pairFirst p) 1) :why \"prose\") acc) acc))\n          (list) (enumerate ls)))\n\nfn textMentions! root: String files: (List String) sym: String accounted: (h/HMap Bool) found: (h/HMap ai/Mention) -> (h/HMap ai/Mention)\n  (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap ai/Mention)) (rel String)] -> (h/HMap ai/Mention)\n          (if (not (listContains? (textExt) (stringLower (pairSecond (c/splitExt rel)))))\n            acc\n            (let [(full (c/joinPath root rel))]\n              (mt (fileStat full)\n                ((err _) acc)\n                ((ok st)\n                  (if (> st.size (textMaxBytes))\n                    acc\n                    (mt (fileReadString full)\n                      ((err _) acc)\n                      ((ok text)\n                        (if (or (not (stringContains? text sym)) (not (c/utf8Valid? text)))\n                          acc\n                          (fold (fn [(a2 (h/HMap ai/Mention)) (m ai/Mention)] -> (h/HMap ai/Mention) (putFound a2 accounted m))\n                                acc (listReverse (proseLines rel text sym))))))))))))\n        found files)\n\nfn padLine n: Int64 -> String\n  (let [(s (stringFromInt64 n))] (str (stringRepeat \"0\" (max 0 (- 12 (stringLength s)))) s))\n\nfn mentionKey m: ai/Mention -> String\n  (str m.rel \"\\x00\" (padLine m.line) \"\\x00\" m.why)\n\nfn sortMentions ms: (List ai/Mention) -> (List ai/Mention)\n  (listSortBy mentionKey ms)\n\nfn dedupeMentions ms: (List ai/Mention) acc: (List ai/Mention) -> (List ai/Mention)\n  (mt (listHead ms)\n    ((none) (listReverse acc))\n    ((some m) (dedupeMentions (optionOr (listTail ms) (list))\n                              (if (mt (listHead acc) ((some h) (= (mentionKey h) (mentionKey m))) ((none) false)) acc (cons m acc)))))\n\nfn sortedSet ms: (List ai/Mention) -> (List ai/Mention)\n  (dedupeMentions (sortMentions ms) (list))\n\nfn firstPerLine ms: (List ai/Mention) seen: (h/HMap Bool) acc: (List ai/Mention) -> (List ai/Mention)\n  (mt (listHead ms)\n    ((none) (listReverse acc))\n    ((some m) (let [(k (keyOf m.rel m.line))]\n                (if (h/hmHas? seen k)\n                  (firstPerLine (optionOr (listTail ms) (list)) seen acc)\n                  (firstPerLine (optionOr (listTail ms) (list)) (h/hmPut seen k true) (cons m acc))))))\n\nfn callKey r: ai/CallRow -> String\n  (str r.rel \"\\x00\" (padLine r.line) \"\\x00\" r.kind \"\\x00\" (optionOr r.via \"\") \"\\x00\" (optionOr r.through \"\") \"\\x00\" r.of)\n\nfn callForm ambiguous: Bool r: ai/CallRow -> String\n  (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr r.rel r.line) \" :kind \" r.kind\n       (mt r.via ((some v) (if (stringEmpty? v) \"\" (str \" :via \" (c/quoted v)))) ((none) \"\"))\n       (mt r.through ((some t) (str \" :through \" t)) ((none) \"\"))\n       (if (and ambiguous (not (stringEmpty? r.of))) (str \" :of \" (c/quoted r.of)) \"\")\n       \")\")\n\nfn splitSymbol symbol: String module: String -> (Pair String String)\n  (if (and (stringContains? symbol \"/\") (stringEmpty? module))\n    (let [(parts (stringSplit symbol \"/\"))]\n      (pair (optionOr (listLast parts) symbol) (stringJoin (listTake parts (- (listLength parts) 1)) \"/\")))\n    (pair symbol module))\n\nfn absentLine dim: String why: String -> String\n  (str \"(:observe :status :absent :dim \" dim \" :absent (python3) :message \\\"python3 could not be run (\" (c/esc why) \"); the python subject checker is absent, so \" dim \" is not answered\\\")\")\n\nfn setOf keys: (List String) -> (h/HMap Bool)\n  (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Bool)) (k String)] -> (h/HMap Bool) (h/hmPut acc k true)) (h/hmEmpty) keys)\n\nfn nonOverlapping text: String sym: String from: Int64 acc: (List Int64) -> (List Int64)\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes text)) (i (c/findFrom bs (bytesLength bs) (stringToBytes sym) from))]\n    (if (< i 0) (listReverse acc) (nonOverlapping text sym (+ i (max 1 (stringLength sym))) (cons i acc))))\n\nfn newlines s: String -> Int64\n  (- (listLength (c/splitByte s 10)) 1)\n\n(schema MS (:f found (h/HMap ai/Mention)) (:f possible (List ai/Mention)))\n\nfn pyMentions pi: p/PyIndex sym: String keys: (h/HMap Bool) accounted: (h/HMap Bool) -> MS\n  (let [(ix pi.ix)\n        (other0 (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Bool)) (dd p/PyDef)] -> (h/HMap Bool) (if (and (= dd.name sym) (not (h/hmHas? keys dd.key))) (h/hmPut acc (keyOf dd.rel dd.line) true) acc))\n                      (h/hmEmpty) (q/allDefs pi)))\n        (other1 (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Bool)) (cs p/CallSite)] -> (h/HMap Bool) (if (and (= (p/lastSeg (p/keyQual cs.callee)) sym) (not (h/hmHas? keys cs.callee))) (h/hmPut acc (keyOf cs.rel cs.line) true) acc))\n                      other0 pi.w.calls))\n        (other (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Bool)) (lk (Pair String Bool))] -> (h/HMap Bool)\n                       (let [(parts (stringSplit (pairFirst lk) \"\\x01\"))]\n                         (if (= (optionOr (listGet parts 2) \"\") sym) (h/hmPut acc (keyOf (optionOr (listGet parts 0) \"\") (optionOr (stringToInt64 (optionOr (listGet parts 1) \"\")) 0)) true) acc)))\n                     other1 (h/hmPairs pi.w.localsAt)))\n        (mods (listSortBy (fn [(m p/PyMod)] -> String m.rel) (h/omValues ix.mods)))]\n    (fold (fn [(st MS) (m p/PyMod)] -> MS\n            (if (not (stringContains? m.src sym))\n              st\n              (fold (fn [(s2 MS) (t d/PyTok)] -> MS\n                      (let [(rel m.rel) (line t.line) (text t.text)]\n                        (cond\n                          ((not (stringContains? text sym)) s2)\n                          ((= t.kind \"COMMENT\") (MS :found (putFound s2.found accounted (ai/Mention :rel rel :line line :why \"comment\")) :possible s2.possible))\n                          ((or (= t.kind \"STRING\") (= t.kind \"FSTRING_MIDDLE\"))\n                            (let [(why (if (h/hmHas? m.docstrings (stringFromInt64 line)) \"docstring\" \"string\"))]\n                              (fold (fn [(s3 MS) (i Int64)] -> MS\n                                      (MS :found (putFound s3.found accounted (ai/Mention :rel rel :line (+ line (newlines (optionOr (stringSlice text 0 i) \"\"))) :why why)) :possible s3.possible))\n                                    s2 (nonOverlapping text sym 0 (list)))))\n                          ((= t.kind \"NAME\")\n                            (cond\n                              ((!= text sym) (MS :found (putFound s2.found accounted (ai/Mention :rel rel :line line :why \"similarName\")) :possible s2.possible))\n                              ((h/hmHas? other (keyOf rel line)) (MS :found (putFound s2.found accounted (ai/Mention :rel rel :line line :why \"otherDefinition\")) :possible s2.possible))\n                              ((h/hmHas? m.importLines (stringFromInt64 line)) (MS :found (putFound s2.found accounted (ai/Mention :rel rel :line line :why \"importOnly\")) :possible s2.possible))\n                              ((h/hmHas? accounted (keyOf rel line)) s2)\n                              (else (MS :found s2.found :possible (cons (ai/Mention :rel rel :line line :why \"unresolved name\") s2.possible)))))\n                          (else s2))))\n                    st m.toks)))\n          (MS :found (h/hmEmpty) :possible (list)) mods))\n\nfn pyCallKey cs: p/CallSite -> String\n  (str cs.rel \"\\x00\" (padLine cs.line) \"\\x00\" cs.kind)\n\nfn pyCallForm ambiguous: Bool pi: p/PyIndex cs: p/CallSite -> String\n  (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr cs.rel cs.line) \" :kind \" cs.kind\n       (mt cs.via ((some v) (if (stringEmpty? v) \"\" (str \" :via \" (c/quoted v)))) ((none) \"\"))\n       (mt cs.through ((some t) (if (stringEmpty? t) \"\" (str \" :through \" t))) ((none) \"\"))\n       (if (and ambiguous (not (stringEmpty? (p/keyMod cs.callee)))) (str \" :of \" (c/quoted (p/keyMod cs.callee))) \"\")\n       \")\")\n\nfn dynHit? targets: (List p/PyDef) dy: p/Dyn -> Bool\n  (listAny? (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> Bool\n              (or (and (= dy.tag \"mod\") (= dd.modName dy.base) (listContains? (list \"function\" \"class\" \"lambda\") dd.kind))\n                  (and (= dy.tag \"inst\") (mt dd.cls ((some cq) (= (p/defKey dd.modName cq) dy.base)) ((none) false)))))\n            targets)\n\nfn defLineKey dd: p/PyDef -> String\n  (str dd.rel \"\\x00\" (padLine dd.line))\n\nfn ! callersOver! root: String files: (List String) pi: p/PyIndex symbol: String module: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (let [(index (ai/buildAslIndex! root files (if (stringContains? symbol \".\") \"\" symbol)))\n        (targets (q/targets pi symbol module))\n        (keys (setOf (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String dd.key) targets)))\n        (leaf (p/lastSeg symbol))\n        (res (if (stringContains? symbol \".\")\n               (ai/AslCallers :defs (list) :calls (list) :possible (list) :excluded (list))\n               (ai/aslCallers index symbol module)))]\n    (if (and (listEmpty? targets) (listEmpty? res.defs))\n      (let [(names (c/sortUnique (listAppend (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String dd.name) (q/allDefs pi)) (ai/defNames index))))\n            (near (c/closeMatches symbol names 3 0.6))]\n        (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_SYMBOL_NOT_FOUND\" (str \"no definition of \" symbol (if (stringEmpty? module) \"\" (str \" in \" module)) \" in this workspace\")\n                           (str \" :symbol \" (c/quoted symbol) \" :nearest (\" (c/joinWith (map c/quoted near) \" \") \")\"))))\n      (let [(calls (listSortBy pyCallKey (filter (fn [(cs p/CallSite)] -> Bool (h/hmHas? keys cs.callee)) pi.w.calls)))\n            (acc0 (setOf (listAppend (map (fn [(cs p/CallSite)] -> String (keyOf cs.rel cs.line)) calls) (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (keyOf dd.rel dd.line)) targets))))\n            (poss0 (fold (fn [(acc (List ai/Mention)) (r p/Ref)] -> (List ai/Mention)\n                           (if (and (h/hmHas? keys r.key) (not (h/hmHas? acc0 (keyOf r.rel r.line)))) (cons (ai/Mention :rel r.rel :line r.line :why \"value reference\") acc) acc))\n                         (list) pi.w.refs))\n            (poss1 (fold (fn [(acc (List ai/Mention)) (dy p/Dyn)] -> (List ai/Mention)\n                           (if (and (dynHit? targets dy) (not (h/hmHas? acc0 (keyOf dy.rel dy.line)))) (cons (ai/Mention :rel dy.rel :line dy.line :why \"getattr with a dynamic name\") acc) acc))\n                         poss0 pi.w.dynamic))\n            (poss2 (fold (fn [(acc (List ai/Mention)) (u p/Untyped)] -> (List ai/Mention)\n                           (if (and (= u.attr leaf) (not (h/hmHas? acc0 (keyOf u.rel u.line)))) (cons (ai/Mention :rel u.rel :line u.line :why \"attribute call on an untyped receiver\") acc) acc))\n                         poss1 pi.w.untyped))\n            (accounted (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Bool)) (m ai/Mention)] -> (h/HMap Bool) (h/hmPut acc (keyOf m.rel m.line) true)) acc0 poss2))\n            (ms (pyMentions pi leaf keys accounted))\n            (found (textMentions! root files leaf (h/hmEmpty) ms.found))\n            (excludedAll (sortMentions (h/hmValues found)))\n            (excluded (listAppend excludedAll (sortedSet res.excluded)))\n            (possible (listAppend (firstPerLine (sortedSet (listAppend poss2 ms.possible)) (h/hmEmpty) (list)) (sortedSet res.possible)))\n            (aslDefMods (map (fn [(d0 (Pair String Int64))] -> String (optionOr (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(m ai/AslMod)] -> Bool (= m.rel (pairFirst d0))) index.mods)) ((some m) (some m.name)) ((none) (none))) \"\")) res.defs))\n            (defMods (c/sortUnique (listAppend (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String dd.modName) targets) aslDefMods)))\n            (ambiguous (> (listLength defMods) 1))\n            (callItems (listAppend (map (fn [(cs p/CallSite)] -> String (pyCallForm ambiguous pi cs)) calls)\n                                   (map (fn [(r ai/CallRow)] -> String (callForm ambiguous r)) (listSortBy callKey res.calls))))\n            (defItems (listAppend\n                        (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr dd.rel dd.line) \" :kind \" dd.kind \" :module \" (c/quoted dd.modName) \")\"))\n                             (listSortBy defLineKey targets))\n                        (map (fn [(d0 (Pair String Int64))] -> String\n                               (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr (pairFirst d0) (pairSecond d0)) \" :kind fn :module \"\n                                    (c/quoted (optionOr (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(m ai/AslMod)] -> Bool (= m.rel (pairFirst d0))) index.mods)) ((some m) (some m.name)) ((none) (none))) \"\")) \")\"))\n                             res.defs)))\n            (possItems (map (fn [(m ai/Mention)] -> String (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr m.rel m.line) \" :why \" (c/quoted m.why) \")\")) possible))\n            (exclItems (map (fn [(m ai/Mention)] -> String (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr m.rel m.line) \" :why \" m.why \")\")) excluded))\n            (langs (c/joinWith (listAppend (if (listEmpty? (h/omValues pi.ix.mods)) (list) (list \"python\")) (if (listEmpty? index.mods) (list) (list \"asl\"))) \" \"))]\n        (mt (c/shortRev! root ctx)\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok rev)\n            (let [(head (str \"(:observe :dim callers :v 1 :symbol \" (c/quoted symbol) (if (stringEmpty? module) \"\" (str \" :module \" (c/quoted module)))\n                             \" :rev \" rev \" :languages (\" langs \") :count (:defs \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength defItems))\n                             \" :calls \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength callItems)) \" :possible \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength possItems))\n                             \" :excluded \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength exclItems)) \")\"\n                             (if ambiguous\n                               (str \" :ambiguous (\" (c/joinWith (map c/quoted defMods) \" \") \") :hint \\\"\" (stringFromInt64 (listLength defMods))\n                                    \" modules define \" (c/esc symbol) \"; each call names its definition in :of; :module m or m/\" (c/esc symbol) \" narrows to one\\\"\")\n                               \"\")))\n                  (tail (str (if (listEmpty? pi.unparsed) \"\" (str \" :unparsed (\" (c/joinWith (map c/quoted (listTake pi.unparsed 5)) \" \") \")\"))\n                             \" :limits \" (c/quoted (callersLimits))))]\n              (c/fitReceipt head (list (c/Section :key \"defs\" :items defItems :limit limit) (c/Section :key \"calls\" :items callItems :limit limit)\n                                       (c/Section :key \"possible\" :items possItems :limit limit) (c/Section :key \"excluded\" :items exclItems :limit limit))\n                            tail \"callers\")))))))\n\nfn ! observeCallers! root: String symbolArg: String moduleArg: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Pair String (Result String String))\n  (let [(sm (splitSymbol symbolArg moduleArg)) (symbol (pairFirst sm)) (module (pairSecond sm))]\n    (mt (c/workspaceFiles! root ctx)\n      ((err e) (pair \"\" (err e)))\n      ((ok files)\n        (mt (p/buildPyIndex root (str \"=\" (p/lastSeg symbol)) files ctx)\n          ((err e) (pair \"\" (err e)))\n          ((ok b)\n            (mt b\n              ((p/pyAbsent why) (pair \"\" (err (absentLine \"callers\" why))))\n              ((p/built pi) (pair pi.warnings (callersOver! root files pi symbol module limit ctx)))))))))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/status.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/status\n  :x [observeStatus! constName?]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/hmap :a h)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyDump :a d)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyIndex :a p)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyQuery :a q)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/callers :a cal)])\n\nfn statusLimits -> String\n  (str \"python only; tests reach a symbol through resolved calls (setUp included), not stored function values; \"\n       \"a patch cuts its target everywhere, not only in the patched namespace\")\n\nfn testsPerDef -> Int64\n  8\n\nfn constName? n: String -> Bool\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes n)) (len (bytesLength bs))]\n    (and (> len 0) (>= (bytesGet bs 0) 65) (<= (bytesGet bs 0) 90)\n         (listAll? (fn [(i Int64)] -> Bool (let [(b (bytesGet bs i))] (or (and (>= b 65) (<= b 90)) (and (>= b 48) (<= b 57)) (= b 95)))) (range 1 len))))\n\nfn boolText b: Bool -> String\n  (if b \"true\" \"false\")\n\n(schema TInfo (:f t p/PyDef) (:f cut (h/HMap Bool)) (:f reached (h/HMap Bool)))\n\nfn count m: (h/HMap Int64) k: String -> Int64\n  (optionOr (h/hmGet m k) 0)\n\nfn bump m: (h/HMap Int64) k: String -> (h/HMap Int64)\n  (h/hmPut m k (+ (count m k) 1))\n\nfn statusForm pi: p/PyIndex dd: p/PyDef callsBy: (h/HMap Int64) refsBy: (h/HMap Int64) infos: (List TInfo) -> String\n  (let [(why (q/stubWhy pi dd))\n        (tforms (fold (fn [(acc (List String)) (ti TInfo)] -> (List String)\n                        (let [(t ti.t)\n                              (mocked (h/hmHas? ti.cut dd.key))\n                              (executes (and (not mocked) (or (h/hmHas? ti.reached dd.key) (= dd.key t.key))))]\n                          (if (not (or mocked executes))\n                            acc\n                            (cons (str \"(:at \" (c/atStr t.rel t.line) \" :test \" (c/quoted t.qual) \" :executes \" (boolText executes)\n                                       \" :mocked \" (boolText mocked) \" :skipped \" (boolText (q/skipped pi t)) \")\")\n                                  acc))))\n                      (list) infos))\n        (all (listReverse tforms))\n        (shown (listTake all (testsPerDef)))\n        (decos (map (fn [(x d/PyNode)] -> String (optionOr x.u \"\")) (d/kids dd.node \"decorator_list\")))]\n    (str \"(:symbol \" (c/quoted dd.qual) \" :at \" (c/atStr dd.rel dd.line) \" :kind \" dd.kind \" :stub \"\n         (mt why ((some w) (str \"true :stubWhy \" (c/quoted w))) ((none) \"false\"))\n         \" :callers \" (stringFromInt64 (count callsBy dd.key)) \" :refs \" (stringFromInt64 (count refsBy dd.key))\n         (if (listEmpty? decos) \"\" (str \" :decorators (\" (c/joinWith (map (fn [(x String)] -> String (c/quoted (p/pyPrefix x 40))) decos) \" \") \")\"))\n         \" :tests (\" (c/joinWith shown \" \") \")\"\n         (if (> (listLength all) (listLength shown)) (str \" :moreTests \" (stringFromInt64 (- (listLength all) (listLength shown)))) \"\")\n         \")\"))\n\nfn padLine n: Int64 -> String\n  (cal/padLine n)\n\n(schema Const (:f mod p/PyMod) (:f name String) (:f line Int64))\n\nfn constOf m: p/PyMod n: String -> Const\n  (Const :mod m :name n :line (mt (h/omGet m.vars n) ((some pr) (pairFirst pr)) ((none) 0)))\n\nfn flagForm pi: p/PyIndex k: Const -> String\n  (let [(reads (optionOr (h/hmGet pi.w.varReads (p/defKey k.mod.name k.name)) (list)))\n        (readers (c/sortUnique (map (fn [(r (Pair String Int64))] -> String (pairFirst r)) reads)))]\n    (str \"(:name \" k.name \" :at \" (c/atStr k.mod.rel k.line) \" :reads \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength reads))\n         \" :readers (\" (c/joinWith (map c/quoted (listTake readers 4)) \" \") \")\"\n         \" :flagUnread \" (boolText (listEmpty? reads)) \")\"))\n\n(schema Sel (:f defs (List p/PyDef)) (:f consts (List Const)))\n\nfn ! selectPath pi: p/PyIndex path: String -> (Result Sel String)\n  (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(m p/PyMod)] -> Bool (= m.rel path)) (h/omValues pi.ix.mods)))\n    ((none)\n      (if (listContains? pi.unparsed path)\n        (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_PARSE\" (str path \" does not parse as Python\") \"\"))\n        (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_BAD_ARG\" (str \"status reads Python files; not a Python file of this workspace: \" path) \"\"))))\n    ((some m)\n      (ok (Sel :defs (listSortBy (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (padLine dd.line))\n                                 (filter (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> Bool (and (= dd.modName m.name) (listContains? (list \"function\" \"method\" \"nested\") dd.kind))) (q/allDefs pi)))\n               :consts (map (fn [(pr (Pair String (Pair Int64 d/PyNode)))] -> Const (constOf m (pairFirst pr)))\n                            (filter (fn [(pr (Pair String (Pair Int64 d/PyNode)))] -> Bool (constName? (pairFirst pr))) (h/omPairs m.vars)))))))\n\nfn ! selectSymbol pi: p/PyIndex symbol: String -> (Result Sel String)\n  (let [(defs (listSortBy (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (str dd.rel \"\\x00\" (padLine dd.line)))\n                          (filter (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> Bool (and (!= dd.kind \"class\") (or (= dd.name symbol) (= dd.qual symbol) (stringEndsWith? dd.qual (str \".\" symbol)))))\n                                  (q/allDefs pi))))\n        (mods (h/omValues pi.ix.mods))\n        (consts (if (constName? symbol) (map (fn [(m p/PyMod)] -> Const (constOf m symbol)) (filter (fn [(m p/PyMod)] -> Bool (h/omHas? m.vars symbol)) mods)) (list)))]\n    (if (and (listEmpty? defs) (listEmpty? consts))\n      (let [(names (c/sortUnique (listAppend (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String dd.name) (q/allDefs pi))\n                                             (fold (fn [(acc (List String)) (m p/PyMod)] -> (List String) (listAppend acc (map (fn [(pr (Pair String (Pair Int64 d/PyNode)))] -> String (pairFirst pr)) (h/omPairs m.vars)))) (list) mods))))\n            (near (c/closeMatches symbol names 3 0.6))]\n        (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_SYMBOL_NOT_FOUND\" (str \"no Python definition or module constant \" symbol \" in this workspace\")\n                           (str \" :symbol \" (c/quoted symbol) \" :nearest (\" (c/joinWith (map c/quoted near) \" \") \")\"))))\n      (ok (Sel :defs defs :consts consts))))\n\nfn ! statusOver! root: String pi: p/PyIndex symbol: String path: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (mt (if (stringEmpty? path) (selectSymbol pi symbol) (selectPath pi path))\n    ((err e) (err e))\n    ((ok sel)\n      (let [(callsBy (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Int64)) (cs p/CallSite)] -> (h/HMap Int64) (bump acc cs.callee)) (h/hmEmpty) pi.w.calls))\n            (refsBy (fold (fn [(acc (h/HMap Int64)) (r p/Ref)] -> (h/HMap Int64) (bump acc r.key)) (h/hmEmpty) pi.w.refs))\n            (infos (map (fn [(t p/PyDef)] -> TInfo (let [(cut (q/patches pi t))] (TInfo :t t :cut cut :reached (q/reach pi t cut)))) (q/testDefs pi)))\n            (defItems (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (statusForm pi dd callsBy refsBy infos)) sel.defs))\n            (consts (listSortBy (fn [(k Const)] -> String (str k.mod.rel \"\\x00\" (padLine k.line))) sel.consts))\n            (flagItems (map (fn [(k Const)] -> String (flagForm pi k)) consts))\n            (stubs (listLength (filter (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> Bool (some? (q/stubWhy pi dd))) sel.defs)))\n            (unread (listLength (filter (fn [(f String)] -> Bool (stringContains? f \":flagUnread true\")) flagItems)))]\n        (mt (c/shortRev! root ctx)\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok rev)\n            (let [(head (str \"(:observe :dim status :v 1\" (if (stringEmpty? symbol) (str \" :path \" (c/quoted path)) (str \" :symbol \" (c/quoted symbol)))\n                             \" :rev \" rev \" :count (:defs \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength defItems)) \" :stubs \" (stringFromInt64 stubs)\n                             \" :flags \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength flagItems)) \" :flagUnread \" (stringFromInt64 unread) \")\"))]\n              (c/fitReceipt head (list (c/Section :key \"defs\" :items defItems :limit limit) (c/Section :key \"flags\" :items flagItems :limit limit))\n                            (str \" :limits \" (c/quoted (statusLimits))) \"status\")))))))\n\nfn ! observeStatus! root: String symbol: String path: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Pair String (Result String String))\n  (mt (c/workspaceFiles! root ctx)\n    ((err e) (pair \"\" (err e)))\n    ((ok files)\n      (mt (p/buildPyIndex root \"\" files ctx)\n        ((err e) (pair \"\" (err e)))\n        ((ok b)\n          (mt b\n            ((p/pyAbsent why) (pair \"\" (err (cal/absentLine \"status\" why))))\n            ((p/built pi) (pair pi.warnings (statusOver! root pi symbol path limit ctx))))))))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/coverage.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/coverage\n  :x [observeCoverage! reqMatch specReqs idToken? stem termGaps sourceSegment decodeError]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/hmap :a h)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyDump :a d)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyIndex :a p)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyQuery :a q)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/callers :a cal)\n      (asl-regex/regex :a re)])\n\nfn coverageLimits -> String\n  (str \"python only; a requirement is served by symbols citing its id and by what a test citing it calls or \"\n       \"patches; behaviour is not run, so a served symbol that is not a stub counts as implemented; \"\n       \":termGaps are requirement words absent from the serving code (advisory)\")\n\nfn byteAt bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (if (and (>= i 0) (< i n)) (bytesGet bs i) -1)\n\nfn upper? b: Int64 -> Bool\n  (and (>= b 65) (<= b 90))\n\nfn digit? b: Int64 -> Bool\n  (and (>= b 48) (<= b 57))\n\nfn runEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 pred: (fn [Int64] -> Bool) -> Int64\n  (if (and (< i n) (pred (bytesGet bs i))) (runEnd bs (+ i 1) n pred) i)\n\nfn spacesEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (let [(k (c/spaceLenAt bs i n))] (if (> k 0) (spacesEnd bs (+ i k) n) i))\n\nfn prefixEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> (Option Int64)\n  (let [(b (byteAt bs i n))\n        (afterMark (cond\n                     ((= b 35) (let [(e (runEnd bs i n (fn [(x Int64)] -> Bool (= x 35))))] (if (<= (- e i) 6) (some e) (none))))\n                     ((or (= b 45) (= b 42) (= b 43)) (some (+ i 1)))\n                     ((digit? b) (let [(e (runEnd bs i n digit?)) (m (byteAt bs e n))] (if (or (= m 46) (= m 41)) (some (+ e 1)) (none))))\n                     (else (none))))]\n    (mt afterMark\n      ((none) (none))\n      ((some e) (let [(s (spacesEnd bs e n))] (if (> s e) (some s) (none))))))\n\nfn markEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 closing: Bool -> (Option Int64)\n  (let [(b (byteAt bs i n))]\n    (cond\n      ((and (= b 42) (= (byteAt bs (+ i 1) n) 42)) (some (+ i 2)))\n      ((and (= b 95) (= (byteAt bs (+ i 1) n) 95)) (some (+ i 2)))\n      ((and (not closing) (= b 91)) (some (+ i 1)))\n      ((and closing (= b 93)) (some (+ i 1)))\n      (else (none))))\n\nfn options first: (Option Int64) fallback: Int64 -> (List Int64)\n  (mt first ((some e) (list e fallback)) ((none) (list fallback)))\n\nfn lookahead? bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Bool\n  (or (>= i n) (> (c/spaceLenAt bs i n) 0) (= (bytesGet bs i) 58) (= (bytesGet bs i) 46) (= (bytesGet bs i) 41))\n\nfn firstSome xs: (List Int64) f: (fn [Int64] -> (Option (Pair String String))) -> (Option (Pair String String))\n  (mt (listHead xs)\n    ((none) (none))\n    ((some x) (mt (f x) ((some r) (some r)) ((none) (firstSome (optionOr (listTail xs) (list)) f)))))\n\nfn restOf line: String i: Int64 -> String\n  (let [(n (stringLength line))\n        (end (if (stringEndsWith? line \"\\n\") (- n 1) n))\n        (bs (stringToBytes line))\n        (nl (runEnd bs i end (fn [(x Int64)] -> Bool (!= x 10))))]\n    (optionOr (stringSlice line (min i nl) nl) \"\"))\n\nfn reqMatch line: String -> (Option (Pair String String))\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes line)) (n (bytesLength bs)) (i0 (spacesEnd bs 0 n))]\n    (firstSome (options (prefixEnd bs i0 n) i0)\n      (fn [(p1 Int64)] -> (Option (Pair String String))\n        (firstSome (options (markEnd bs p1 n false) p1)\n          (fn [(p2 Int64)] -> (Option (Pair String String))\n            (let [(le (runEnd bs p2 n upper?)) (len (- le p2))]\n              (if (or (< len 1) (> len 4))\n                (none)\n                (let [(q0 (if (and (= (byteAt bs le n) 45) (digit? (byteAt bs (+ le 1) n))) (+ le 1) le))\n                      (q1 (runEnd bs q0 n digit?))]\n                  (if (= q1 q0)\n                    (none)\n                    (firstSome (options (if (and (= (byteAt bs q1 n) 46) (digit? (byteAt bs (+ q1 1) n))) (some (runEnd bs (+ q1 1) n digit?)) (none)) q1)\n                      (fn [(p3 Int64)] -> (Option (Pair String String))\n                        (firstSome (options (markEnd bs p3 n true) p3)\n                          (fn [(p4 Int64)] -> (Option (Pair String String))\n                            (if (lookahead? bs p4 n) (some (pair (optionOr (stringSlice line p2 p3) \"\") (restOf line p4))) (none)))))))))))))))\n\nfn dropMarks s: String -> String\n  (c/catAll (filter (fn [(ch String)] -> Bool (not (listContains? (list \"*\" \"_\" \"`\" \"[\" \"]\") ch))) (stringChars s)))\n\n(schema Req (:f id String) (:f text String))\n\nfn specReqs text: String -> (List Req)\n  (listReverse\n    (fold (fn [(acc (List Req)) (line String)] -> (List Req)\n            (mt (reqMatch line)\n              ((none) acc)\n              ((some m)\n                (if (listAny? (fn [(r Req)] -> Bool (= r.id (pairFirst m))) acc)\n                  acc\n                  (cons (Req :id (pairFirst m) :text (c/stripChars (dropMarks (pairSecond m)) \" :.-\")) acc)))))\n          (list) (c/keepEndsLines text)))\n\nfn hex2 b: Int64 -> String\n  (str (optionOr (stringSlice \"0123456789abcdef\" (/ b 16) (+ (/ b 16) 1)) \"\") (optionOr (stringSlice \"0123456789abcdef\" (mod b 16) (+ (mod b 16) 1)) \"\"))\n\nfn posText a: Int64 k: Int64 bs: Bytes -> String\n  (if (= k 1)\n    (str \"byte 0x\" (hex2 (bytesGet bs a)) \" in position \")\n    \"bytes in position \")\n\nfn errMsg bs: Bytes base: Int64 at: Int64 k: Int64 reason: String -> String\n  (str \"UnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode \" (posText at k bs)\n       (if (= k 1) (stringFromInt64 (- at base)) (str (stringFromInt64 (- at base)) \"-\" (stringFromInt64 (- (- (+ at k) base) 1))))\n       \": \" reason)\n\nfn needOf b0: Int64 -> Int64\n  (cond ((< b0 128) 1) ((and (>= b0 194) (< b0 224)) 2) ((and (>= b0 224) (< b0 240)) 3) ((and (>= b0 240) (< b0 245)) 4) (else 0))\n\nfn validPrefix bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (let [(b0 