       (live (keysOf (filter (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> Bool (not (some? (q/stubWhy pi dd)))) servedDefs)))\n        (cls (fold (fn [(acc (Pair (List p/PyDef) (Pair (List p/PyDef) (List p/PyDef)))) (ti TI)] -> (Pair (List p/PyDef) (Pair (List p/PyDef) (List p/PyDef)))\n                     (let [(reachCut (union ti.reached ti.cut))]\n                       (if (and (not (h/hmHas? rkeys ti.t.key)) (not (meets? (inter cited live) reachCut)))\n                         acc\n                         (cond\n                           ((meets? ti.cut served) (pair (pairFirst acc) (pair (cons ti.t (pairFirst (pairSecond acc))) (pairSecond (pairSecond acc)))))\n                           (ti.skip (pair (pairFirst acc) (pair (pairFirst (pairSecond acc)) (cons ti.t (pairSecond (pairSecond acc))))))\n                           ((meets? live (union ti.reached ti.callees)) (pair (cons ti.t (pairFirst acc)) (pairSecond acc)))\n                           (else acc)))))\n                   (pair (list) (pair (list) (list))) infos))\n        (counted (listReverse (pairFirst cls)))\n        (mocked (listReverse (pairFirst (pairSecond cls))))\n        (skippedL (listReverse (pairSecond (pairSecond cls))))\n        (tested (not (listEmpty? counted)))\n        (why0 (cond\n                ((listEmpty? servedDefs) (str \"no symbol or test cites \" rid))\n                ((not (listEmpty? stubs)) (c/joinWith (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (str dd.qual \" is a stub (\" (optionOr (q/stubWhy pi dd) \"\") \")\")) (listTake stubs 2)) \", \"))\n                (else (str \"served by \" (c/joinWith (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String dd.qual) (listTake servedDefs 2)) \", \")))))\n        (why (if tested\n               why0\n               (str why0 \"; \" (cond\n                                ((and (not (listEmpty? mocked)) (listEmpty? skippedL)) \"its tests are mocked\")\n                                ((and (not (listEmpty? skippedL)) (listEmpty? mocked)) \"its tests are skipped\")\n                                ((not (listEmpty? mocked)) \"mocked and skipped tests only\")\n                                (else \"no test executes a serving symbol\")))))\n        (sources (listAppend (map (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> String (srcOf pi dd)) servedDefs) (map (fn [(ti TI)] -> String (srcOf pi ti.t)) rtests)))\n        (gaps (if (listEmpty? servedDefs) (list) (termGaps r.text sources)))]\n    (pair (str \"(:id \" rid \" :implemented \" (boolText implemented) \" :tested \" (boolText tested)\n               \" :by \" (labels servedDefs) \" :tests \" (labels counted) \" :mocked \" (labels mocked)\n               \" :skipped \" (labels skippedL) \" :termGaps (\" (c/joinWith (map c/quoted gaps) \" \") \")\"\n               \" :why \" (c/quoted why) \")\")\n          (and implemented tested)))\n\nfn ! coverageOver! root: String spec: String reqs: (List Req) pi: p/PyIndex limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (let [(tests (q/testDefs pi))\n        (code (filter (fn [(dd p/PyDef)] -> Bool (and (not (testIsTest? pi dd.key)) (!= dd.kind \"lambda\"))) (q/allDefs pi)))\n        (infos (map (fn [(t p/PyDef)] -> TI (let [(cut (q/patches pi t))] (TI :t t :cut cut :skip (q/skipped pi t) :reached (q/reach pi t cut) :callees (q/directCallees pi t)))) tests))\n        (items (map (fn [(r Req)] -> (Pair Req (Pair String Bool)) (pair r (reqItem pi code infos r))) reqs))\n        (done (map (fn [(pr (Pair Req (Pair String Bool)))] -> String (pairFirst pr).id) (filter (fn [(pr (Pair Req (Pair String Bool)))] -> Bool (pairSecond (pairSecond pr))) items)))\n        (texts (map (fn [(pr (Pair Req (Pair String Bool)))] -> String (pairFirst (pairSecond pr))) items))]\n    (mt (c/shortRev! root ctx)\n      ((err e) (err e))\n      ((ok rev)\n        (let [(head (str \"(:observe :dim coverage :v 1 :spec \" (c/quoted spec) \" :rev \" rev \" :count (:reqs \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength reqs))\n                         \" :implemented \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength (filter (fn [(t String)] -> Bool (stringContains? t \":implemented true\")) texts)))\n                         \" :tested \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength (filter (fn [(t String)] -> Bool (stringContains? t \":tested true\")) texts)))\n                         \") :done (\" (c/joinWith done \" \") \")\"))]\n          (c/fitReceipt head (list (c/Section :key \"reqs\" :items texts :limit limit)) (str \" :limits \" (c/quoted (coverageLimits))) \"coverage\")))))\n\nfn ! observeCoverage! root: String spec: String idRx: (Option re/Regex) limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Pair String (Result String String))\n  (mt (fileReadString (c/joinPath root spec))\n    ((err e) (pair \"\" (err (if (= e \"permissionDenied\") (str \"PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied: \" (pyQuote (c/joinPath root spec))) (str \"OSError: \" e \": \" (pyQuote (c/joinPath root spec)))))))\n    ((ok raw)\n      (mt (decodeError raw)\n        ((some msg) (pair \"\" (err msg)))\n        ((none)\n          (let [(all (specReqs (c/universalNewlines raw)))\n                (reqs (mt idRx ((some rx) (filter (fn [(r Req)] -> Bool (some? (re/regex-match-full! rx r.id))) all)) ((none) all)))]\n            (if (listEmpty? reqs)\n              (pair \"\" (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_NO_REQUIREMENTS\" (str \"no requirement ids (e.g. R1, REQ-2 at the start of a heading or list item) in \" spec) \"\")))\n              (mt (c/workspaceFiles! root ctx)\n                ((err e) (pair \"\" (err e)))\n                ((ok files)\n                  (mt (p/buildPyIndex root \"\" files ctx)\n                    ((err e) (pair \"\" (err e)))\n                    ((ok b)\n                      (mt b\n                        ((p/pyAbsent why) (pair \"\" (err (cal/absentLine \"coverage\" why))))\n                        ((p/built pi) (pair pi.warnings (coverageOver! root spec reqs pi limit ctx))))))))))))))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/tokenCost.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/tokenCost\n  :x [observeTokenCost! kindOf shebangInterp?]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)\n      (asl-tokenizer/tokenizer :a tok)])\n\n(schema Entry (:f path String) (:f kind String) (:f count Int64) (:f binary Bool))\n\nfn foreignExts -> (List String)\n  (list \".c\" \".h\" \".py\" \".pyw\" \".sh\" \".bash\" \".zsh\" \".js\" \".mjs\" \".cjs\" \".jsx\" \".ts\" \".tsx\" \".rs\" \".go\" \".swift\" \".rb\" \".java\" \".kt\" \".cpp\" \".cc\" \".hpp\" \".m\" \".mm\" \".zig\" \".lua\" \".pl\" \".php\" \".ps1\")\n\nfn shebangNames -> (List String)\n  (list \"bash\" \"sh\" \"zsh\" \"python\" \"python3\" \"node\" \"perl\" \"ruby\")\n\nfn hasNul bs: Bytes i: Int64 end: Int64 -> Bool\n  (cond ((>= i end) false) ((= (bytesGet bs i) 0) true) (else (hasNul bs (+ i 1) end)))\n\nfn firstLineEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 end: Int64 -> Int64\n  (cond ((>= i end) end) ((= (bytesGet bs i) 10) (+ i 1)) (else (firstLineEnd bs (+ i 1) end)))\n\nfn asciiDigit? b: Int64 -> Bool\n  (and (>= b 48) (<= b 57))\n\nfn versionRest? bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Bool\n  (cond ((>= i n) true)\n        ((let [(b (bytesGet bs i))] (or (asciiDigit? b) (= b 46) (= b 95) (= b 45))) (versionRest? bs (+ i 1) n))\n        (else false))\n\nfn versionTail? t: String -> Bool\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes t)) (n (bytesLength bs))\n        (i0 (if (and (> n 0) (let [(b (bytesGet bs 0))] (or (= b 45) (= b 95) (= b 46)))) 1 0))\n        (i1 (if (and (< i0 n) (= (bytesGet bs i0) 118)) (+ i0 1) i0))]\n    (or (= n 0) (and (< i1 n) (asciiDigit? (bytesGet bs i1)) (versionRest? bs (+ i1 1) n))))\n\nfn shebangInterp? interp: String -> Bool\n  (let [(low (stringLower interp))]\n    (listAny? (fn [(name String)] -> Bool\n                (and (stringStartsWith? low name) (versionTail? (optionOr (stringSlice low (stringLength name) (stringLength low)) \"\"))))\n              (shebangNames)))\n\nfn wordsLoop s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 start: Int64 acc: (List String) -> (List String)\n  (let [(flush (fn [(end Int64)] -> (List String) (if (> end start) (cons (optionOr (stringSlice s start end) \"\") acc) acc)))]\n    (if (>= i n)\n      (listReverse (flush n))\n      (let [(sp (c/spaceLenAt bs i n))]\n        (if (> sp 0)\n          (wordsLoop s bs (+ i sp) n (+ i sp) (flush i))\n          (wordsLoop s bs (+ i 1) n start acc)))))\n\nfn pyWords s: String -> (List String)\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes s))] (wordsLoop s bs 0 (bytesLength bs) 0 (list)))\n\nfn skipFlags words: (List String) -> (Option String)\n  (mt (listHead words)\n    ((none) (none))\n    ((some w) (if (stringStartsWith? w \"-\") (skipFlags (optionOr (listTail words) (list))) (some w))))\n\nfn shebangKind txt: String -> String\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes txt))\n        (end (firstLineEnd bs 0 (min 1024 (bytesLength bs))))\n        (first (optionOr (stringSlice txt 0 end) \"\"))]\n    (if (or (hasNul bs 0 end) (not (c/utf8Valid? first)))\n      \"other\"\n      (let [(line (c/pyStrip first))]\n        (if (not (stringStartsWith? line \"#!\"))\n          \"other\"\n          (let [(words (pyWords (c/pyStrip (optionOr (stringSlice line 2 (stringLength line)) \"\"))))]\n            (mt (listHead words)\n              ((none) \"other\")\n              ((some w0)\n                (let [(interp (if (= (c/baseName w0) \"env\") (skipFlags (optionOr (listTail words) (list))) (some w0)))]\n                  (mt interp\n                    ((none) \"other\")\n                    ((some w) (if (shebangInterp? (c/baseName w)) \"foreign\" \"other\")))))))))))\n\nfn kindOf path: String txt: String -> String\n  (let [(ext (stringLower (pairSecond (c/splitExt path))))]\n    (cond ((or (= ext \".md\") (= ext \".txt\")) \"prose\")\n          ((= ext \".asl\") \"asl\") ((= ext \".asn\") \"asn\")\n          ((listContains? (foreignExts) ext) \"foreign\")\n          ((not (stringEmpty? ext)) \"other\")\n          (else (shebangKind txt))))\n\nfn entries! tok: tok/Tokenizer root: String paths: (List String) -> (List Entry)\n  (listReverse (fold (fn [(acc (List Entry)) (rel String)] -> (List Entry)\n          (mt (fileReadString (c/joinPath root rel))\n            ((err _) acc)\n            ((ok txt)\n              (let [(bs (stringToBytes txt))\n                    (binary (or (hasNul bs 0 (bytesLength bs)) (not (c/utf8Valid? txt))))]\n                (cons (Entry :path rel :kind (kindOf rel txt) :count (if binary 0 (tok/countTokensBytes! tok bs)) :binary binary) acc)))))\n        (list) paths))\n\nfn inKind rows: (List Entry) kind: String -> (List Entry)\n  (filter (fn [(e Entry)] -> Bool (= e.kind kind)) rows)\n\nfn sumCounts rows: (List Entry) -> Int64\n  (fold (fn [(n Int64) (e Entry)] -> Int64 (+ n e.count)) 0 rows)\n\nfn textEntries rows: (List Entry) -> (List Entry)\n  (filter (fn [(e Entry)] -> Bool (not e.binary)) rows)\n\nfn binaryCount rows: (List Entry) -> Int64\n  (fold (fn [(n Int64) (e Entry)] -> Int64 (+ n (if e.binary 1 0))) 0 rows)\n\nfn maxCount rows: (List Entry) -> String\n  (mt (listHead (listSortBy (fn [(e Entry)] -> Int64 (- 0 e.count)) (textEntries rows)))\n    ((none) \"\")\n    ((some e) (str \" :max (\" (c/quoted e.path) \" \" (stringFromInt64 e.count) \")\")))\n\nfn kindForm rows: (List Entry) kind: String -> String\n  (let [(same (inKind rows kind))]\n    (str \"(:kind \" kind \" :files \" (stringFromInt64 (listLength same)) \" :tok \" (stringFromInt64 (sumCounts same)) (maxCount same) \")\"))\n\nfn sortEntries rows: (List Entry) -> (List Entry)\n  (listSortBy (fn [(e Entry)] -> Int64 (- 0 e.count)) rows)\n\nfn topEntry e: Entry -> String\n  (str \"(\" (c/quoted e.path) \" \" (stringFromInt64 e.count) \")\")\n\nfn topItems rows: (List Entry) n: Int64 -> String\n  (c/joinWith (map topEntry (listTake (textEntries rows) n)) \" \")\n\nfn receiptFit head: String rows: (List Entry) total: Int64 shown: Int64 -> (Pair String Int64)\n  (let [(receipt (str head \" :top (\" (topItems rows shown) \") :more \" (stringFromInt64 (- total shown)) \")\"))]\n    (if (or (< (stringLength receipt) 4096) (= shown 0))\n      (pair receipt shown)\n      (receiptFit head rows total (- shown 1))))\n\nfn tokenizerDir! root: String ctx: c/Ctx -> (Option String)\n  (let [(roots (listAppend (mt (c/ctxEnv ctx \"ASL_CLI_ROOT\") ((none) (list)) ((some r) (if (stringEmpty? r) (list) (list r)))) (list root)))]\n    (listHead (filter c/isDir? (map (fn [(r String)] -> String (c/joinPath r \"data/tokenizers\")) roots))))\n\nfn runDate! ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (if (stringEmpty? ctx.date) (localDate) (ok ctx.date))\n\nfn tokenReceipt! root: String scope: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (mt (tokenizerDir! root ctx)\n    ((none) (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_NO_ENCODER\" \"data/tokenizers is not found under ASL_CLI_ROOT or the workspace; token counts are not estimated\" \" :method none\")))\n    ((some dataDir)\n      (mt (tok/loadTokenizer! dataDir)\n        ((err e) (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_TOKENIZER\" e \" :method none\")))\n        ((ok tokenizer)\n          (mt (runDate! ctx)\n            ((err e) (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_DATE\" (str \"local date unavailable: \" e) \"\")))\n            ((ok date)\n              (mt (c/git! (if (stringEmpty? scope) (list \"ls-files\" \"-z\") (list \"ls-files\" \"-z\" \"--\" scope)) root ctx)\n                ((err e) (err e))\n                ((ok git)\n                  (if (!= (pairFirst git) 0)\n                    (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_GIT\" (str \"git ls-files failed in \" root) \"\"))\n                    (let [(paths (c/sortUnique (filter (fn [(p String)] -> Bool (not (stringEmpty? p))) (c/splitByte (pairSecond git) 0))))\n                          (rows (sortEntries (entries! tokenizer root paths)))\n                          (rev (resultOr (c/shortRev! root ctx) \"none\"))\n                          (kinds (c/joinWith (map (fn [(k String)] -> String (kindForm rows k)) (list \"prose\" \"asl\" \"asn\" \"foreign\" \"other\")) \" \"))\n                          (head (str \"(:observe :dim tokenCost :v 1 :method o200kBase :scope \" (c/quoted (if (stringEmpty? scope) \".\" scope)) \" :rev \" rev \" :date \" date \" :kinds (\" kinds \") :binary \" (stringFromInt64 (binaryCount rows)) \" :missing \" (stringFromInt64 (- (listLength paths) (listLength rows)))))\n                          (total (listLength (textEntries rows)))\n                          (fit (receiptFit head rows total (min limit total)))\n                          (receipt (pairFirst fit))]\n                      (if (>= (stringLength receipt) 4096)\n                        (err (c/rejectLine \"ERR_RECEIPT_TOO_LARGE\" \"tokenCost receipt exceeds 4096 bytes with an empty :top\" \"\"))\n                        (ok receipt))))))))))))\n\nfn ! observeTokenCost! root: String scope: String limit: Int64 ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result String String)\n  (tokenReceipt! root scope limit ctx)\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/hmap.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/hmap\n  :x [HMap OMap hashKey hmEmpty hmGet hmHas? hmPut hmPairs hmValues hmSize omEmpty omGet omHas? omPut omPairs omValues omSize]\n  :i [])\n\nenum HMap\n  (hmNil)\n  (hmNode h: Int64 k: String v: V l: (HMap V) r: (HMap V))\n\nenum OMap\n  (omOf seq: (HMap (Pair Int64 V)) n: Int64)\n\nfn hashLoop bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 h: Int64 -> Int64\n  (if (>= i n) h (hashLoop bs (+ i 1) n (mod (+ (* h 131) (bytesGet bs i) 7) 2147483629)))\n\nfn hashKey k: String -> Int64\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes k))] (hashLoop bs 0 (bytesLength bs) 5381))\n\nfn hmEmpty -> (HMap V)\n  (hmNil)\n\nfn hmFind m: (HMap V) h: Int64 k: String -> (Option V)\n  (mt m\n    ((hmNil) (none))\n    ((hmNode h2 k2 v l r)\n      (cond\n        ((and (= h h2) (= k k2)) (some v))\n        ((or (< h h2) (and (= h h2) (< k k2))) (hmFind l h k))\n        (else (hmFind r h k)))))\n\nfn hmGet m: (HMap V) k: String -> (Option V)\n  (hmFind m (hashKey k) k)\n\nfn hmHas? m: (HMap V) k: String -> Bool\n  (some? (hmGet m k))\n\nfn hmIns m: (HMap V) h: Int64 k: String v: V -> (HMap V)\n  (mt m\n    ((hmNil) (hmNode h k v (hmNil) (hmNil)))\n    ((hmNode h2 k2 v2 l r)\n      (cond\n        ((and (= h h2) (= k k2)) (hmNode h k v l r))\n        ((or (< h h2) (and (= h h2) (< k k2))) (hmNode h2 k2 v2 (hmIns l h k v) r))\n        (else (hmNode h2 k2 v2 l (hmIns r h k v))))))\n\nfn hmPut m: (HMap V) k: String v: V -> (HMap V)\n  (hmIns m (hashKey k) k v)\n\nfn hmCollect m: (HMap V) acc: (List (Pair String V)) -> (List (Pair String V))\n  (mt m\n    ((hmNil) acc)\n    ((hmNode h k v l r) (hmCollect l (cons (pair k v) (hmCollect r acc)))))\n\nfn hmPairs m: (HMap V) -> (List (Pair String V))\n  (hmCollect m (list))\n\nfn hmValues m: (HMap V) -> (List V)\n  (map (fn [(p (Pair String V))] -> V (pairSecond p)) (hmPairs m))\n\nfn hmSize m: (HMap V) -> Int64\n  (mt m ((hmNil) 0) ((hmNode h k v l r) (+ 1 (hmSize l) (hmSize r))))\n\nfn omEmpty -> (OMap V)\n  (omOf (hmNil) 0)\n\nfn omGet m: (OMap V) k: String -> (Option V)\n  (mt m ((omOf t n) (optionMap (fn [(p (Pair Int64 V))] -> V (pairSecond p)) (hmGet t k))))\n\nfn omHas? m: (OMap V) k: String -> Bool\n  (some? (omGet m k))\n\nfn omPut m: (OMap V) k: String v: V -> (OMap V)\n  (mt m\n    ((omOf t n)\n      (mt (hmGet t k)\n        ((some p) (omOf (hmPut t k (pair (pairFirst p) v)) n))\n        ((none) (omOf (hmPut t k (pair n v)) (+ n 1))))))\n\nfn omPairs m: (OMap V) -> (List (Pair String V))\n  (mt m\n    ((omOf t n)\n      (map (fn [(p (Pair String (Pair Int64 V)))] -> (Pair String V) (pair (pairFirst p) (pairSecond (pairSecond p))))\n           (listSortBy (fn [(p (Pair String (Pair Int64 V)))] -> Int64 (pairFirst (pairSecond p))) (hmPairs t)))))\n\nfn omValues m: (OMap V) -> (List V)\n  (map (fn [(p (Pair String V))] -> V (pairSecond p)) (omPairs m))\n\nfn omSize m: (OMap V) -> Int64\n  (mt m ((omOf t n) (hmSize t)))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/aslIndex.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/aslIndex\n  :x [Tok AslMod AslIndex CallRow Mention AslCallers aslLex buildAslIndex! aslCallers defNames]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/hmap :a h)])\n\n(schema Tok (:f kind String) (:f val String) (:f line Int64) (:f idx Int64))\n\n(schema AslMod\n  (:f rel String) (:f name String) (:f imports (List (Pair String String))) (:f exports (List Int64))\n  (:f named (List (Pair String String))) (:f imported (List Int64)) (:f defs (List (Pair String Int64))) (:f toks (List Tok))\n  (:f alias (List (Pair String (Option String)))) (:f namedRel (List (Pair String (Option String)))) (:f full Bool))\n\n(schema AslIndex (:f mods (List AslMod)) (:f byName (h/HMap (List AslMod))))\n\n(schema CallRow (:f rel String) (:f line Int64) (:f kind String) (:f via (Option String)) (:f through (Option String)) (:f of String))\n\n(schema Mention (:f rel String) (:f line Int64) (:f why String))\n\n(schema AslCallers (:f defs (List (Pair String Int64))) (:f calls (List CallRow)) (:f possible (List Mention)) (:f excluded (List Mention)))\n\nfn sliceOf s: String a: Int64 b: Int64 -> String\n  (optionOr (stringSlice s a b) \"\")\n\nfn delim? b: Int64 -> Bool\n  (or (= b 40) (= b 41) (= b 91) (= b 93) (= b 123) (= b 125) (= b 34) (= b 59) (= b 44))\n\nfn atomEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (if (or (>= i n) (delim? (bytesGet bs i)) (> (c/spaceLenAt bs i n) 0)) i (atomEnd bs (+ i 1) n))\n\nfn strEnd bs: Bytes j: Int64 n: Int64 line: Int64 -> (Pair Int64 Int64)\n  (if (or (>= j n) (= (bytesGet bs j) 34))\n    (pair j line)\n    (let [(b (bytesGet bs j))]\n      (cond ((= b 92) (strEnd bs (+ j 2) n line))\n            ((= b 10) (strEnd bs (+ j 1) n (+ line 1)))\n            (else (strEnd bs (+ j 1) n line)))))\n\nfn lineEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (if (or (>= i n) (= (bytesGet bs i) 10)) i (lineEnd bs (+ i 1) n))\n\nfn lexLoop text: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 line: Int64 k: Int64 depth: Int64 stop: Bool acc: (List Tok) -> (List Tok)\n  (if (or (>= i n) (and stop (> k 0) (<= depth 0)))\n    (listReverse acc)\n    (let [(b (bytesGet bs i))]\n      (cond\n        ((= b 10) (lexLoop text bs (+ i 1) n (+ line 1) k depth stop acc))\n        ((= b 44) (lexLoop text bs (+ i 1) n line k depth stop acc))\n        ((> (c/spaceLenAt bs i n) 0) (lexLoop text bs (+ i (c/spaceLenAt bs i n)) n line k depth stop acc))\n        ((= b 59) (let [(j (lineEnd bs i n))] (lexLoop text bs j n line (+ k 1) depth stop (cons (Tok :kind \"comment\" :val (sliceOf text i j) :line line :idx k) acc))))\n        ((= b 34) (let [(e (strEnd bs (+ i 1) n line)) (j (pairFirst e))]\n                    (lexLoop text bs (+ j 1) n (pairSecond e) (+ k 1) depth stop (cons (Tok :kind \"str\" :val (sliceOf text (+ i 1) (min j n)) :line line :idx k) acc))))\n        ((or (= b 40) (= b 123)) (lexLoop text bs (+ i 1) n line (+ k 1) (+ depth 1) stop (cons (Tok :kind \"(\" :val (sliceOf text i (+ i 1)) :line line :idx k) acc)))\n        ((or (= b 41) (= b 125)) (lexLoop text bs (+ i 1) n line (+ k 1) (- depth 1) stop (cons (Tok :kind \")\" :val (sliceOf text i (+ i 1)) :line line :idx k) acc)))\n        ((= b 91) (lexLoop text bs (+ i 1) n line (+ k 1) (+ depth 1) stop (cons (Tok :kind \"[\" :val \"[\" :line line :idx k) acc)))\n        ((= b 93) (lexLoop text bs (+ i 1) n line (+ k 1) (- depth 1) stop (cons (Tok :kind \"]\" :val \"]\" :line line :idx k) acc)))\n        (else (let [(j (atomEnd bs i n))] (lexLoop text bs j n line (+ k 1) depth stop (cons (Tok :kind \"atom\" :val (sliceOf text i j) :line line :idx k) acc)))))))\n\nfn aslLex text: String -> (List Tok)\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes text))] (lexLoop text bs 0 (bytesLength bs) 1 0 0 false (list)))\n\nfn headLex text: String -> (List Tok)\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes text))] (lexLoop text bs 0 (bytesLength bs) 1 0 0 true (list)))\n\nfn nameCharsEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (if (or (>= i n) (> (c/spaceLenAt bs i n) 0)\n          (let [(b (bytesGet bs i))] (or (= b 40) (= b 41) (= b 91) (= b 93) (= b 34) (= b 59))))\n    i\n    (nameCharsEnd bs (+ i 1) n))\n\nfn spacesEnd bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> Int64\n  (let [(k (c/spaceLenAt bs i n))] (if (= k 0) i (spacesEnd bs (+ i k) n)))\n\nfn defOfLine raw: String -> (Option String)\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes raw)) (n (bytesLength bs))\n        (s0 (if (and (> n 0) (= (bytesGet bs 0) 40)) 1 0))\n        (kw (cond ((= (sliceOf raw s0 (+ s0 2)) \"fn\") (+ s0 2)) ((= (sliceOf raw s0 (+ s0 4)) \"defn\") (+ s0 4))\n                  ((= (sliceOf raw s0 (+ s0 5)) \"const\") (+ s0 5)) ((= (sliceOf raw s0 (+ s0 4)) \"test\") (+ s0 4)) (else -1)))]\n    (if (< kw 0) (none)\n      (let [(sp (spacesEnd bs kw n))]\n        (if (= sp kw) (none)\n          (let [(e (nameCharsEnd bs sp n))]\n            (if (= e sp) (none) (some (sliceOf raw sp e))))))))\n\nfn pairGet kv: (List (Pair String Int64)) k: String -> (Option Int64)\n  (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(p (Pair String Int64))] -> Bool (= (pairFirst p) k)) kv)) ((some p) (some (pairSecond p))) ((none) (none)))\n\nfn strGet kv: (List (Pair String String)) k: String -> (Option String)\n  (c/mapGetOr kv k)\n\nfn optGet kv: (List (Pair String (Option String))) k: String -> (Option String)\n  (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(p (Pair String (Option String)))] -> Bool (= (pairFirst p) k)) kv)) ((some p) (pairSecond p)) ((none) (none)))\n\nfn setKv kv: (List (Pair String String)) k: String v: String -> (List (Pair String String))\n  (if (some? (strGet kv k)) (map (fn [(p (Pair String String))] -> (Pair String String) (if (= (pairFirst p) k) (pair k v) p)) kv) (listAppend kv (list (pair k v))))\n\nfn setDefault kv: (List (Pair String String)) k: String v: String -> (List (Pair String String))\n  (if (some? (strGet kv k)) kv (listAppend kv (list (pair k v))))\n\nfn defStart? b: Int64 -> Bool\n  (or (= b 40) (= b 102) (= b 100) (= b 99) (= b 116))\n\nfn defsLoop text: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 line: Int64 acc: (List (Pair String Int64)) -> (List (Pair String Int64))\n  (if (> i n)\n    acc\n    (let [(e (lineEnd bs i n))\n          (acc2 (if (and (< i n) (defStart? (bytesGet bs i)))\n                  (mt (defOfLine (sliceOf text i e))\n                    ((some name) (if (some? (pairGet acc name)) acc (cons (pair name line) acc)))\n                    ((none) acc))\n                  acc))]\n      (defsLoop text bs (+ e 1) n (+ line 1) acc2)))\n\nfn defsOf text: String -> (List (Pair String Int64))\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes text))] (defsLoop text bs 0 (bytesLength bs) 1 (list)))\n\n(schema Hdr (:f name (Option String)) (:f imports (List (Pair String String))) (:f exports (List Int64))\n            (:f named (List (Pair String String))) (:f imported (List Int64)))\n\nfn emptyHdr -> Hdr\n  (Hdr :name (none) :imports (list) :exports (list) :named (list) :imported (list))\n\nfn tail xs: (List Tok) -> (List Tok)\n  (optionOr (listTail xs) (list))\n\nfn headKind xs: (List Tok) -> String\n  (mt (listHead xs) ((some t) t.kind) ((none) \"\"))\n\nfn headVal xs: (List Tok) -> String\n  (mt (listHead xs) ((some t) t.val) ((none) \"\"))\n\n(schema Imp (:f rest (List Tok)) (:f alias (Option String)) (:f named (List (Pair String String))) (:f imported (List Int64)))\n\nfn namedAtoms toks: (List Tok) target: String named: (List (Pair String String)) imported: (List Int64) -> Imp\n  (mt (listHead toks)\n    ((some t) (if (= t.kind \"atom\")\n                (namedAtoms (tail toks) target (setKv named t.val target) (cons t.idx imported))\n                (Imp :rest toks :alias (none) :named named :imported imported)))\n    ((none) (Imp :rest toks :alias (none) :named named :imported imported)))\n\nfn importForm toks: (List Tok) target: String st: Imp -> Imp\n  (mt (listHead toks)\n    ((none) (with st :rest (list)))\n    ((some t)\n      (if (= t.kind \")\")\n        (with st :rest (tail toks))\n        (if (and (or (= t.val \":a\") (= t.val \":as\")) (not (listEmpty? (tail toks))))\n          (if (= (headKind (tail toks)) \"[\")\n            (let [(na (namedAtoms (tail (tail toks)) target st.named st.imported))]\n              (importForm na.rest target (Imp :rest (list) :alias st.alias :named na.named :imported na.imported)))\n            (importForm (tail toks) target (with st :rest (list) :alias (some (headVal (tail toks))))))\n          (importForm (tail toks) target st)))))\n\nfn hdrLoop toks: (List Tok) depth: Int64 key: String h: Hdr -> Hdr\n  (if (<= depth 0)\n    h\n    (mt (listHead toks)\n      ((none) h)\n      ((some t)\n        (let [(kind t.kind) (val t.val) (imp? (or (= key \":i\") (= key \":import\")))]\n          (cond\n            ((or (= kind \"(\") (= kind \"[\"))\n              (if (and (= kind \"(\") (= depth 2) imp? (= (headKind (tail toks)) \"atom\"))\n                (let [(target (headVal (tail toks)))\n                      (st (importForm (tail (tail toks)) target (Imp :rest (list) :alias (none) :named h.named :imported h.imported)))\n                      (imports (setDefault (setKv h.imports (optionOr st.alias target) target) target target))]\n                  (hdrLoop st.rest depth key (Hdr :name h.name :imports imports :exports h.exports :named st.named :imported st.imported)))\n                (hdrLoop (tail toks) (+ depth 1) key h)))\n            ((or (= kind \")\") (= kind \"]\")) (hdrLoop (tail toks) (- depth 1) key h))\n            ((and (= kind \"atom\") (= depth 1) (stringStartsWith? val \":\")) (hdrLoop (tail toks) depth val h))\n            ((and (= kind \"atom\") (= depth 2) imp?)\n              (let [(last (optionOr (listLast (stringSplit val \"/\")) val))]\n                (hdrLoop (tail toks) depth key (with h :imports (setDefault (setKv h.imports val val) last val)))))\n            ((and (= kind \"atom\") (= depth 2) (or (= key \":x\") (= key \":export\")))\n              (hdrLoop (tail toks) depth key (with h :exports (cons t.idx h.exports))))\n            (else (hdrLoop (tail toks) depth key h)))))))\n\nfn header toks: (List Tok) -> Hdr\n  (mt (listHead toks)\n    ((none) (emptyHdr))\n    ((some t0)\n      (let [(r1 (tail toks)) (r2 (tail r1))]\n        (if (or (!= t0.kind \"(\") (!= (headKind r1) \"atom\") (!= (headVal r1) \"module\") (!= (headKind r2) \"atom\"))\n          (emptyHdr)\n          (let [(h (hdrLoop (tail r2) 1 \"\" (emptyHdr)))]\n            (Hdr :name (some (headVal r2)) :imports h.imports :exports h.exports :named h.named :imported h.imported))))))\n\nfn byNameGet idx: (h/HMap (List AslMod)) name: String -> (List AslMod)\n  (optionOr (h/hmGet idx name) (list))\n\nfn byNameAdd idx: (h/HMap (List AslMod)) m: AslMod -> (h/HMap (List AslMod))\n  (h/hmPut idx m.name (listAppend (byNameGet idx m.name) (list m)))\n\nfn noMod -> AslMod\n  (AslMod :rel \"\" :name \"\" :imports (list) :exports (list) :named (list) :imported (list) :defs (list) :toks (list) :alias (list) :namedRel (list) :full false)\n\nfn commonLen a: String b: String -> Int64\n  (let [(pa (stringSplit a \"/\")) (pb (stringSplit b \"/\"))\n        (common (fold (fn [(acc (Pair Bool (List String))) (p (Pair String String))] -> (Pair Bool (List String))\n                        (if (and (pairFirst acc) (= (pairFirst p) (pairSecond p))) (pair true (cons (pairFirst p) (pairSecond acc))) (pair false (pairSecond acc))))\n                      (pair true (list)) (zip pa pb)))]\n    (stringLength (c/joinWith (listReverse (pairSecond common)) \"/\")))\n\nfn bestNear ms: (List AslMod) importerRel: String -> String\n  (let [(score (fn [(m AslMod)] -> Int64 (if (and (not (stringEmpty? (c/dirName m.rel))) (not (stringEmpty? (c/dirName importerRel)))) (commonLen m.rel importerRel) 0)))]\n    (fold (fn [(best AslMod) (m AslMod)] -> AslMod (if (> (score m) (score best)) m best)) (optionOr (listHead ms) (noMod)) ms).rel)\n\n(schema Near (:f suffix (h/HMap (List String))) (:f stem (h/HMap (List String))))\n\nfn addRel m: (h/HMap (List String)) k: String rel: String -> (h/HMap (List String))\n  (h/hmPut m k (cons rel (optionOr (h/hmGet m k) (list))))\n\nfn nearOf mods: (List AslMod) -> Near\n  (fold (fn [(acc Near) (m AslMod)] -> Near\n          (let [(parts (stringSplit m.name \"/\"))\n                (sufs (map (fn [(i Int64)] -> String (c/joinWith (listDrop parts i) \"/\")) (range 1 (listLength parts))))]\n            (Near :suffix (fold (fn [(a2 (h/HMap (List String))) (k String)] -> (h/HMap (List String)) (addRel a2 k m.rel)) acc.suffix sufs)\n                  :stem (addRel acc.stem (pairFirst (c/splitExt (c/baseName m.rel))) m.rel))))\n        (Near :suffix (h/hmEmpty) :stem (h/hmEmpty)) mods)\n\nfn moduleOf idx: (h/HMap (List AslMod)) near: Near target: String importer: String importerRel: String -> (Option String)\n  (let [(parts (let [(ps (stringSplit importer \"/\"))] (listTake ps (- (listLength ps) 1))))\n        (names (cons target (map (fn [(k Int64)] -> String (c/joinWith (listAppend (listTake parts k) (list target)) \"/\")) (listReverse (range 1 (+ (listLength parts) 1))))))\n        (hit (listHead (filter (fn [(nm String)] -> Bool (not (listEmpty? (byNameGet idx nm)))) names)))]\n    (mt hit\n      ((some nm) (some (bestNear (byNameGet idx nm) importerRel)))\n      ((none)\n        (let [(cands (c/sortUnique (listAppend (optionOr (h/hmGet near.suffix target) (list)) (optionOr (h/hmGet near.stem target) (list)))))]\n          (if (= (listLength cands) 1) (listHead cands) (none))))))\n\nfn loadMod! root: String rel: String sym: String -> (Option AslMod)\n  (mt (fileReadString (c/joinPath root rel))\n    ((err _) (none))\n    ((ok raw)\n      (if (not (c/utf8Valid? raw))\n        (none)\n        (let [(text (c/universalNewlines raw)) (full (and (not (stringEmpty? sym)) (stringContains? text sym)))\n              (toks (if full (aslLex text) (headLex text))) (h (header toks))]\n          (some (AslMod :rel rel :name (optionOr h.name (pairFirst (c/splitExt (c/baseName rel)))) :imports h.imports :exports h.exports\n                        :named h.named :imported h.imported :defs (defsOf text) :toks (if full toks (list)) :alias (list) :namedRel (list) :full full))))))\n\nfn buildAslIndex! root: String files: (List String) sym: String -> AslIndex\n  (let [(mods0 (fold (fn [(acc (List AslMod)) (rel String)] -> (List AslMod)\n                       (if (stringEndsWith? rel \".asl\") (mt (loadMod! root rel sym) ((some m) (cons m acc)) ((none) acc)) acc))\n                     (list) files))\n        (mods1 (listReverse mods0))\n        (byName (fold byNameAdd (h/hmEmpty) mods1))\n        (near (nearOf mods1))\n        (resolve (fn [(m AslMod) (kv (List (Pair String String)))] -> (List (Pair String (Option String)))\n                   (if m.full (map (fn [(p (Pair String String))] -> (Pair String (Option String)) (pair (pairFirst p) (moduleOf byName near (pairSecond p) m.name m.rel))) kv) (list))))\n        (mods (map (fn [(m AslMod)] -> AslMod\n                     (AslMod :rel m.rel :name m.name :imports m.imports :exports m.exports :named m.named :imported m.imported\n                             :defs m.defs :toks m.toks :alias (resolve m m.imports) :namedRel (resolve m m.named) :full m.full))\n                   mods1))]\n    (AslIndex :mods mods :byName byName))\n\nfn defNames ai: AslIndex -> (List String)\n  (fold (fn [(acc (List String)) (m AslMod)] -> (List String) (listAppend acc (map (fn [(p (Pair String Int64))] -> String (pairFirst p)) m.defs))) (list) ai.mods)\n\nfn wordByte? b: Int64 extra: (List Int64) -> Bool\n  (or (and (>= b 48) (<= b 57)) (and (>= b 65) (<= b 90)) (and (>= b 97) (<= b 122)) (= b 95) (listContains? extra b))\n\nfn exactIn? text: String sym: String -> Bool\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes text)) (n (bytesLength bs)) (pat (stringToBytes sym)) (m (bytesLength pat))]\n    (exactFrom bs n pat m 0))\n\nfn exactFrom bs: Bytes n: Int64 pat: Bytes m: Int64 i: Int64 -> Bool\n  (let [(at (c/findFrom bs n pat i))]\n    (cond\n      ((< at 0) false)\n      ((and (or (= at 0) (not (wordByte? (bytesGet bs (- at 1)) (list 45 47))))\n            (or (>= (+ at m) n) (not (wordByte? (bytesGet bs (+ at m)) (list 45 63 33)))))\n        true)\n      (else (exactFrom bs n pat m (+ at 1)))))\n\nfn afterSlash val: String -> String\n  (optionOr (listLast (stringSplit val \"/\")) val)\n\nfn beforeSlash val: String -> String\n  (let [(parts (stringSplit val \"/\"))] (c/joinWith (listTake parts (- (listLength parts) 1)) \"/\"))\n\n(schema Walk (:f frames (List (Option String))) (:f calls (List CallRow)) (:f possible (List Mention)) (:f excluded (List Mention)) (:f prev (Option Tok)))\n\nfn modNameOf ai: AslIndex rel: String -> String\n  (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(m AslMod)] -> Bool (= m.rel rel)) ai.mods)) ((some m) m.name) ((none) \"\"))\n\nfn onAtom ai: AslIndex m: AslMod sym: String targets: (List String) defLine: (Option Int64) t: Tok w: Walk -> Walk\n  (let [(val t.val) (line t.line) (rel m.rel)\n        (prevAtomKw (mt w.prev ((some p) (and (= p.kind \"atom\") (listContains? (list \"fn\" \"defn\" \"const\" \"test\") p.val))) ((none) false)))\n        (isDef (and prevAtomKw (mt defLine ((some d) (= d line)) ((none) false))))\n        (ex (fn [(why String)] -> Walk (with w :excluded (cons (Mention :rel rel :line line :why why) w.excluded) :prev (some t))))\n        (po (fn [(why String)] -> Walk (with w :possible (cons (Mention :rel rel :line line :why why) w.possible) :prev (some t))))\n        (same (with w :prev (some t)))]\n    (cond\n      ((and (listContains? m.exports t.idx) (= val sym)) (ex \"export\"))\n      ((and (listContains? m.imported t.idx) (= val sym)) (ex \"importOnly\"))\n      (else\n        (let [(slashed (and (stringContains? val \"/\") (not (stringStartsWith? val \"/\"))))\n              (res (cond\n                     ((and slashed (= (afterSlash val) sym)) (pair (optGet m.alias (beforeSlash val)) (some val)))\n                     (slashed (pair (none) (none)))\n                     ((= val sym)\n                       (let [(tr (if (some? (pairGet m.defs sym)) (some rel) (optGet m.namedRel sym)))]\n                         (pair tr (if (= (optionOr tr \"\\x00\") rel) (none) (some (str \"import \" (optionOr (strGet m.named sym) \"\")))))))\n                     (else (pair (none) (none)))))\n              (targetRel (pairFirst res)) (via (pairSecond res))]\n          (mt targetRel\n            ((none)\n              (cond\n                ((or (= val sym) (= (afterSlash val) sym))\n                  (cond ((and isDef (not (listContains? targets rel))) (ex \"otherDefinition\"))\n                        ((not isDef) (po (str \"unresolved name \" val)))\n                        (else same)))\n                ((and (stringContains? val sym) (not (stringStartsWith? val \":\"))) (ex \"similarName\"))\n                (else same)))\n            ((some tr)\n              (cond\n                ((not (listContains? targets tr)) (ex \"otherDefinition\"))\n                (isDef same)\n                (else\n                  (let [(isHead (and (mt w.prev ((some p) (= p.kind \"(\")) ((none) false))\n                                     (mt (listHead w.frames) ((some fh) (= (optionOr fh \"\\x00\") val)) ((none) false))))]\n                    (if (not isHead)\n                      (po \"value reference\")\n                      (let [(ctx (listAny? (fn [(h (Option String))] -> Bool (= (optionOr h \"\") \"fn\")) (optionOr (listTail w.frames) (list))))\n                            (how (cond ((stringContains? val \"/\") \"attribute\") ((some? via) \"alias\") (else \"direct\")))\n                            (row (CallRow :rel rel :line line :kind (if ctx \"lambda\" how) :via via\n                                          :through (if (and ctx (!= how \"direct\")) (some how) (none)) :of (modNameOf ai tr)))]\n                        (with w :calls (cons row w.calls) :prev (some t)))))))))))))\n\nfn walkToks ai: AslIndex m: AslMod sym: String targets: (List String) defLine: (Option Int64) toks: (List Tok) w: Walk -> Walk\n  (mt (listHead toks)\n    ((none) w)\n    ((some t)\n      (let [(rest (tail toks)) (kind t.kind)]\n        (cond\n          ((or (= kind \"(\") (= kind \"[\"))\n            (let [(head (if (and (= kind \"(\") (= (headKind rest) \"atom\")) (some (headVal rest)) (none)))]\n              (walkToks ai m sym targets defLine rest (with w :frames (cons head w.frames) :prev (some t)))))\n          ((or (= kind \")\") (= kind \"]\"))\n            (walkToks ai m sym targets defLine rest (with w :frames (optionOr (listTail w.frames) (list)) :prev (some t))))\n          ((or (= kind \"comment\") (= kind \"str\"))\n            (walkToks ai m sym targets defLine rest\n                      (with w :excluded (if (exactIn? t.val sym) (cons (Mention :rel m.rel :line t.line :why (if (= kind \"comment\") \"comment\" \"string\")) w.excluded) w.excluded) :prev (some t))))\n          (else (walkToks ai m sym targets defLine rest (onAtom ai m sym targets defLine t w)))))))\n\nfn aslCallers ai: AslIndex sym: String module: String -> AslCallers\n  (let [(targets (listSort (map (fn [(m AslMod)] -> String m.rel)\n                                (filter (fn [(m AslMod)] -> Bool (and (some? (pairGet m.defs sym))\n                                                                      (or (stringEmpty? module) (= module m.rel) (= module m.name) (stringEndsWith? m.name (str \"/\" module)))))\n                                        ai.mods))))\n        (defs (map (fn [(rel String)] -> (Pair String Int64) (pair rel (optionOr (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(m AslMod)] -> Bool (= m.rel rel)) ai.mods)) ((some m) (pairGet m.defs sym)) ((none) (none))) 0))) targets))\n        (sorted (listSortBy (fn [(m AslMod)] -> String m.rel) (filter (fn [(m AslMod)] -> Bool m.full) ai.mods)))\n        (w (fold (fn [(acc Walk) (m AslMod)] -> Walk\n                   (let [(r (walkToks ai m sym targets (pairGet m.defs sym) m.toks (Walk :frames (list) :calls acc.calls :possible acc.possible :excluded acc.excluded :prev (none))))]\n                     r))\n                 (Walk :frames (list) :calls (list) :possible (list) :excluded (list) :prev (none)) sorted))]\n    (AslCallers :defs defs :calls (listReverse w.calls) :possible (listReverse w.possible) :excluded (listReverse w.excluded)))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/pyDump.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/pyDump\n  :x [PyF PyNode PyTok PyFile Dump dumpScript runDump! fld kid kids optKids sfield ifield children walkBfs isType? constStr constKind]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)])\n\n(enum PyF\n  (:c fNode [(n PyNode)])\n  (:c fNone [])\n  (:c fStr [(s String)])\n  (:c fInt [(i Int64)])\n  (:c fConst [(kind String) (s (Option String))])\n  (:c fList [(xs (List PyF))]))\n\n(schema PyNode\n  (:f id Int64) (:f type String) (:f line Int64) (:f endLine Int64) (:f col Int64) (:f endCol Int64) (:f hasEnd Bool)\n  (:f fields (List (Pair String PyF))) (:f u (Option String)))\n\n(schema PyTok (:f kind String) (:f text String) (:f line Int64))\n\n(schema PyFile (:f rel String) (:f ok Bool) (:f tree (Option PyNode)) (:f toks (List PyTok)))\n\n(enum Dump\n  (:c dumped [(files (List PyFile)) (warnings String)])\n  (:c absent [(why String)]))\n\nfn dumpScript -> String\n  (c/joinWith\n    (list\n      \"import ast,io,sys,tokenize\"\n      \"o=sys.stdout.buffer\"\n      \"root=sys.argv[1]\"\n      \"W=sys.argv[2]\"\n      \"OPS=(ast.expr_context,ast.operator,ast.unaryop,ast.boolop,ast.cmpop)\"\n      \"TK={tokenize.COMMENT:'COMMENT',tokenize.STRING:'STRING',tokenize.NAME:'NAME'}\"\n      \"if hasattr(tokenize,'FSTRING_MIDDLE'):TK[tokenize.FSTRING_MIDDLE]='FSTRING_MIDDLE'\"\n      \"def S(s):\"\n      \" b=s.encode('utf-8','surrogatepass');return b'S%d:'%len(b)+b\"\n      \"def V(v):\"\n      \" if v is None:return b'-'\"\n      \" if isinstance(v,int):return b'I%d'%v\"\n      \" if isinstance(v,str):return S(v)\"\n      \" return S(type(v).__name__)\"\n      \"def E(n,f,v):\"\n      \" if f=='value' and isinstance(n,(ast.Constant,ast.MatchSingleton)):return b'K'+S(type(v).__name__)+b' '+(S(v) if isinstance(v,str) else b'-')\"\n      \" if isinstance(v,OPS):return S(type(v).__name__)\"\n      \" if isinstance(v,ast.AST):return b'C'\"\n      \" if isinstance(v,list):return b'L%d'%len(v)+b''.join(b' '+(b'C' if isinstance(x,ast.AST) and not isinstance(x,OPS) else V(x)) for x in v)\"\n      \" return V(v)\"\n      \"def keep(n,f,v):\"\n      \" return (v is not None and v!=[]) or (f=='value' and isinstance(n,(ast.Constant,ast.MatchSingleton)))\"\n      \"for rel in sys.argv[3:]:\"\n      \" try:\"\n      \"  with open(root+'/'+rel,encoding='utf-8') as fh:src=fh.read()\"\n      \"  tree=ast.parse(src,filename=rel)\"\n      \" except (OSError,UnicodeDecodeError,SyntaxError,ValueError):\"\n      \"  o.write(b'F '+S(rel)+b' I0\\\\n');continue\"\n      \" o.write(b'F '+S(rel)+b' I1\\\\n')\"\n      \" U=set()\"\n      \" for n in ast.walk(tree):\"\n      \"  if isinstance(n,ast.Call):U.add(id(n.func))\"\n      \"  for x in getattr(n,'decorator_list',None) or ():U.add(id(x))\"\n      \" todo=[(tree,0)]\"\n      \" while todo:\"\n      \"  n,done=todo.pop()\"\n      \"  if not done:\"\n      \"   todo.append((n,1))\"\n      \"   kids=[]\"\n      \"   for f,v in ast.iter_fields(n):\"\n      \"    if isinstance(v,ast.AST) and not isinstance(v,OPS):kids.append(v)\"\n      \"    elif isinstance(v,list):kids.extend(x for x in v if isinstance(x,ast.AST) and not isinstance(x,OPS))\"\n      \"   todo.extend((k,0) for k in reversed(kids))\"\n      \"   continue\"\n      \"  g=lambda a:V(getattr(n,a,None))\"\n      \"  fs=[(f,v) for f,v in ast.iter_fields(n) if keep(n,f,v)]\"\n      \"  o.write(b'N '+S(type(n).__name__)+b' '+g('lineno')+b' '+g('end_lineno')+b' '+g('col_offset')+b' '+g('end_col_offset')+b' '+(S(ast.unparse(n)) if id(n) in U else b'-')+b' I%d'%len(fs)+b''.join(b' '+S(f)+b' '+E(n,f,v) for f,v in fs)+b'\\\\n')\"\n      \" try:\"\n      \"  for t in tokenize.generate_tokens(io.StringIO(src).readline):\"\n      \"   if t.type in TK and (t.type==tokenize.COMMENT or (W and W[1:] in t.string)):o.write(b'T '+S(TK[t.type])+b' I%d '%t.start[0]+S(t.string)+b'\\\\n')\"\n      \" except (tokenize.TokenError,SyntaxError):pass\"\n      \"o.write(b'E\\\\n')\")\n    \"\\n\")\n\nfn fld n: PyNode name: String -> PyF\n  (mt (listHead (filter (fn [(p (Pair String PyF))] -> Bool (= (pairFirst p) name)) n.fields))\n    ((some p) (pairSecond p))\n    ((none) (fNone)))\n\nfn kid n: PyNode name: String -> (Option PyNode)\n  (mt (fld n name) ((fNode k) (some k)) (_ (none)))\n\nfn fNodeOpt f: PyF -> (Option PyNode)\n  (mt f ((fNode k) (some k)) (_ (none)))\n\nfn kids n: PyNode name: String -> (List PyNode)\n  (mt (fld n name)\n    ((fList xs) (fold (fn [(acc (List PyNode)) (f PyF)] -> (List PyNode) (mt f ((fNode k) (cons k acc)) (_ acc))) (list) (listReverse xs)))\n    (_ (list)))\n\nfn optKids n: PyNode name: String -> (List (Option PyNode))\n  (mt (fld n name) ((fList xs) (map fNodeOpt xs)) (_ (list)))\n\nfn sfield n: PyNode name: String -> (Option String)\n  (mt (fld n name) ((fStr s) (some s)) (_ (none)))\n\nfn ifield n: PyNode name: String -> Int64\n  (mt (fld n name) ((fInt i) i) (_ 0))\n\nfn isType? n: PyNode t: String -> Bool\n  (= n.type t)\n\nfn constKind n: PyNode -> (Option String)\n  (if (isType? n \"Constant\") (mt (fld n \"value\") ((fConst k s) (some k)) (_ (none))) (none))\n\nfn constStr n: PyNode -> (Option String)\n  (if (isType? n \"Constant\") (mt (fld n \"value\") ((fConst k s) (if (= k \"str\") s (none))) (_ (none))) (none))\n\nfn children n: PyNode -> (List PyNode)\n  (listReverse\n    (fold (fn [(acc (List PyNode)) (p (Pair String PyF))] -> (List PyNode)\n            (mt (pairSecond p)\n              ((fNode k) (cons k acc))\n              ((fList xs) (fold (fn [(a2 (List PyNode)) (f PyF)] -> (List PyNode) (mt f ((fNode k) (cons k a2)) (_ a2))) acc xs))\n              (_ acc)))\n          (list) n.fields))\n\nfn bfsLoop front: (List PyNode) next: (List PyNode) acc: (List PyNode) -> (List PyNode)\n  (mt (listHead front)\n    ((some n) (bfsLoop (optionOr (listTail front) (list)) (listAppend (listReverse (children n)) next) (cons n acc)))\n    ((none) (if (listEmpty? next) (listReverse acc) (bfsLoop (listReverse next) (list) acc))))\n\nfn walkBfs n: PyNode -> (List PyNode)\n  (bfsLoop (list n) (list) (list))\n\n(schema Build (:f stack (List PyNode)) (:f size Int64) (:f next Int64) (:f files (List PyFile)) (:f cur (Option PyFile)))\n\n(enum RawF\n  (:c rChild [])\n  (:c rVal [(v PyF)])\n  (:c rList [(xs (List RawF))]))\n\n(schema Got (:f v PyF) (:f at Int64))\n\nfn digitsAt bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 acc: Int64 -> (Pair Int64 Int64)\n  (if (and (< i n) (>= (bytesGet bs i) 48) (<= (bytesGet bs i) 57)) (digitsAt bs (+ i 1) n (+ (* acc 10) (- (bytesGet bs i) 48))) (pair acc i))\n\nfn intAt bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> (Pair Int64 Int64)\n  (if (and (< i n) (= (bytesGet bs i) 45))\n    (let [(p (digitsAt bs (+ i 1) n 0))] (pair (- 0 (pairFirst p)) (pairSecond p)))\n    (digitsAt bs i n 0))\n\nfn valAt s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> (Result Got String)\n  (let [(b (if (< i n) (bytesGet bs i) -1))]\n    (cond\n      ((= b 45) (ok (Got :v (fNone) :at (+ i 1))))\n      ((= b 73) (let [(p (intAt bs (+ i 1) n))] (ok (Got :v (fInt (pairFirst p)) :at (pairSecond p)))))\n      ((= b 83)\n        (let [(p (digitsAt bs (+ i 1) n 0)) (start (+ (pairSecond p) 1)) (end (+ (+ (pairSecond p) 1) (pairFirst p)))]\n          (if (or (> end n) (>= (pairSecond p) n) (!= (bytesGet bs (pairSecond p)) 58))\n            (err (str \"python3 ast dump: bad string at byte \" (stringFromInt64 i)))\n            (ok (Got :v (fStr (optionOr (stringSlice s start end) \"\")) :at end)))))\n      (else (err (str \"python3 ast dump: bad value at byte \" (stringFromInt64 i))))))\n\nfn strOf v: PyF -> String\n  (mt v ((fStr x) x) (_ \"\"))\n\nfn intOf v: PyF -> Int64\n  (mt v ((fInt x) x) (_ 0))\n\n(schema RawGot (:f r RawF) (:f at Int64))\n\nfn listElems s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 k: Int64 acc: (List RawF) -> (Result RawGot String)\n  (if (<= k 0)\n    (ok (RawGot :r (rList (listReverse acc)) :at i))\n    (let [(j (+ i 1))]\n      (if (and (< j n) (= (bytesGet bs j) 67))\n        (listElems s bs (+ j 1) n (- k 1) (cons (rChild) acc))\n        (mt (valAt s bs j n)\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok g) (listElems s bs g.at n (- k 1) (cons (rVal g.v) acc)))))))\n\nfn specAt s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 -> (Result RawGot String)\n  (let [(b (if (< i n) (bytesGet bs i) -1))]\n    (cond\n      ((= b 67) (ok (RawGot :r (rChild) :at (+ i 1))))\n      ((= b 75)\n        (mt (valAt s bs (+ i 1) n)\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok k) (mt (valAt s bs (+ k.at 1) n)\n                    ((err e) (err e))\n                    ((ok v) (ok (RawGot :r (rVal (fConst (strOf k.v) (mt v.v ((fStr x) (some x)) (_ (none))))) :at v.at)))))))\n      ((= b 76) (let [(p (digitsAt bs (+ i 1) n 0))] (listElems s bs (pairSecond p) n (pairFirst p) (list))))\n      (else (mt (valAt s bs i n) ((err e) (err e)) ((ok g) (ok (RawGot :r (rVal g.v) :at g.at)))))))\n\n(schema RawField (:f name String) (:f r RawF))\n\nfn fieldsAt s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 k: Int64 acc: (List RawField) -> (Result (Pair (List RawField) Int64) String)\n  (if (<= k 0)\n    (ok (pair (listReverse acc) i))\n    (mt (valAt s bs (+ i 1) n)\n      ((err e) (err e))\n      ((ok nm) (mt (specAt s bs (+ nm.at 1) n)\n                 ((err e) (err e))\n                 ((ok sp) (fieldsAt s bs sp.at n (- k 1) (cons (RawField :name (strOf nm.v) :r sp.r) acc)))))))\n\nfn childCount r: RawF -> Int64\n  (mt r ((rChild) 1) ((rList xs) (fold (fn [(acc Int64) (x RawF)] -> Int64 (+ acc (childCount x))) 0 xs)) (_ 0))\n\nfn fill r: RawF kidsLeft: (List PyNode) -> (Pair PyF (List PyNode))\n  (mt r\n    ((rChild) (mt (listHead kidsLeft) ((some k) (pair (fNode k) (optionOr (listTail kidsLeft) (list)))) ((none) (pair (fNone) kidsLeft))))\n    ((rVal v) (pair v kidsLeft))\n    ((rList xs)\n      (let [(t (fold (fn [(acc (Pair (List PyF) (List PyNode))) (x RawF)] -> (Pair (List PyF) (List PyNode))\n                       (let [(q (fill x (pairSecond acc)))] (pair (cons (pairFirst q) (pairFirst acc)) (pairSecond q))))\n                     (pair (list) kidsLeft) xs))]\n        (pair (fList (listReverse (pairFirst t))) (pairSecond t)))))\n\n(schema Head (:f vals (List PyF)) (:f at Int64))\n\nfn headVals s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 k: Int64 acc: (List PyF) -> (Result Head String)\n  (if (<= k 0)\n    (ok (Head :vals (listReverse acc) :at i))\n    (mt (valAt s bs (+ i 1) n)\n      ((err e) (err e))\n      ((ok g) (headVals s bs g.at n (- k 1) (cons g.v acc)))))\n\nfn nodeAt s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 b: Build -> (Result (Pair Build Int64) String)\n  (mt (headVals s bs i n 7 (list))\n    ((err e) (err e))\n    ((ok h)\n      (let [(at (fn [(k Int64)] -> PyF (optionOr (listGet h.vals k) (fNone))))]\n        (mt (fieldsAt s bs h.at n (intOf (at 6)) (list))\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok fp)\n            (let [(raw (pairFirst fp))\n                  (need (fold (fn [(acc Int64) (f RawField)] -> Int64 (+ acc (childCount f.r))) 0 raw))]\n              (if (< b.size need)\n                (err (str \"python3 ast dump: node \" (strOf (at 0)) \" needs \" (stringFromInt64 need) \" children\"))\n                (let [(built (fold (fn [(acc (Pair (List (Pair String PyF)) (List PyNode))) (f RawField)] -> (Pair (List (Pair String PyF)) (List PyNode))\n                                     (let [(q (fill f.r (pairSecond acc)))] (pair (cons (pair f.name (pairFirst q)) (pairFirst acc)) (pairSecond q))))\n                                   (pair (list) (listReverse (listTake b.stack need))) raw))\n                      (endLine (at 2)) (endCol (at 4))\n                      (node (PyNode :id b.next :type (strOf (at 0)) :line (intOf (at 1)) :endLine (intOf endLine) :col (intOf (at 3)) :endCol (intOf endCol)\n                                    :hasEnd (and (mt endLine ((fInt x) true) (_ false)) (mt endCol ((fInt x) true) (_ false)))\n                                    :fields (listReverse (pairFirst built)) :u (mt (at 5) ((fStr x) (some x)) (_ (none)))))]\n                  (ok (pair (with b :stack (cons node (listDrop b.stack need)) :size (+ (- b.size need) 1) :next (+ b.next 1))\n                            (+ (pairSecond fp) 1)))))))))))\n\nfn closeFile b: Build -> Build\n  (mt b.cur\n    ((none) b)\n    ((some f)\n      (let [(tree (if f.ok (listHead b.stack) (none)))]\n        (with b :stack (list) :size 0 :files (cons (PyFile :rel f.rel :ok f.ok :tree tree :toks (listReverse f.toks)) b.files) :cur (none)))))\n\nfn recordsAt s: String bs: Bytes i: Int64 n: Int64 b: Build -> (Result Build String)\n  (let [(tag (if (< i n) (bytesGet bs i) -1))]\n    (cond\n      ((= tag 69) (ok (closeFile b)))\n      ((= tag 78) (mt (nodeAt s bs (+ i 1) n b) ((err e) (err e)) ((ok r) (recordsAt s bs (pairSecond r) n (pairFirst r)))))\n      ((= tag 84)\n        (mt (headVals s bs (+ i 1) n 3 (list))\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok h)\n            (mt b.cur\n              ((none) (err \"python3 ast dump: token before a file\"))\n              ((some f)\n                (let [(v (fn [(k Int64)] -> PyF (optionOr (listGet h.vals k) (fNone))))\n                      (tok (PyTok :kind (strOf (v 0)) :line (intOf (v 1)) :text (strOf (v 2))))]\n                  (recordsAt s bs (+ h.at 1) n\n                             (with b :cur (some (PyFile :rel f.rel :ok f.ok :tree (none) :toks (cons tok f.toks)))))))))))\n      ((= tag 70)\n        (mt (headVals s bs (+ i 1) n 2 (list))\n          ((err e) (err e))\n          ((ok h)\n            (let [(b2 (closeFile b)) (v (fn [(k Int64)] -> PyF (optionOr (listGet h.vals k) (fNone))))]\n              (recordsAt s bs (+ h.at 1) n\n                         (Build :stack (list) :size 0 :next b2.next :files b2.files\n                                :cur (some (PyFile :rel (strOf (v 0)) :ok (= (intOf (v 1)) 1) :tree (none) :toks (list)))))))))\n      ((< tag 0) (err \"python3 ast dump ended early\"))\n      (else (err (str \"python3 ast dump: unknown record at byte \" (stringFromInt64 i))))))\n\nfn parseDump out: String -> (Result (List PyFile) String)\n  (let [(bs (stringToBytes out))]\n    (mt (recordsAt out bs 0 (bytesLength bs) (Build :stack (list) :size 0 :next 1 :files (list) :cur (none)))\n      ((err e) (err e))\n      ((ok b) (ok (listReverse b.files)))))\n\nfn ! runDump! root: String want: String rels: (List String) ctx: c/Ctx -> (Result Dump String)\n  (if (listEmpty? rels)\n    (ok (dumped (list) \"\"))\n    (mt (c/runArgv! (listAppend (list \"python3\" \"-I\" \"-c\" (dumpScript) root want) rels) ctx.cwd ctx)\n      ((err e) (ok (absent e)))\n      ((ok p)\n        (if (!= p.code 0)\n          (err (str \"python3 ast dump exited \" (stringFromInt64 p.code) \": \" p.errText))\n          (mt (parseDump p.out)\n            ((err e) (err e))\n            ((ok files) (ok (dumped files p.errText))))))))\n")
(:file :tree "tcNone" :path "asl/tools/observe/pyIndex.asl" :text "(module ws/asl/tools/observe/pyIndex\n  :x [Binding PyMod PyDef Res Scope CallSite Ref Dyn Untyped W Ix PyIndex Built\n      defKey keyMod keyQual lastSeg modOf defOf defKind buildPyIndex resolveSym resolveExpr resolveName methodOf importBindings pyPrefix]\n  :i [(ws/asl/tools/observe/common :a c)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/hmap :a h)\n      (ws/asl/tools/observe/pyDump :a d)])\n\n(enum Binding\n  (:c bMod [(name String) (how String)])\n  (:c bSym [(base String) (name String) (how String)])\n  (:c bStar [(base String)]))\n\n(schema PyMod\n  (:f rel String) (:f name String) (:f isPkg Bool) (:f pkg String) (:f src String) (:f tree d/PyNode) (:f isTest Bool) (:f toks (List d/PyTok))\n  (:f top (h/HMap String)) (:f bindings (h/HMap Binding)) (:f vars (h/OMap (Pair Int64 d/PyNode))) (:f varTypes (h/HMap String))\n  (:f stars (List String)) (:f docstrings (h/HMap Bool)) (:f importLines (h/HMap Bool)) (:f comments (List (Pair Int64 String))))\n\n(schema PyDef\n  (:f key String) (:f modName String) (:f rel String) (:f qual String) (:f name String) (:f kind String) (:f node d/PyNode)\n  (:f cls (Option String)) (:f line Int64) (:f end Int64))\n\n(schema Res (:f tag String) (:f val String) (:f how String) (:f hops Int64))\n\n(schema Scope\n  (:f kind String) (:f key (Option String)) (:f names (h/HMap Bool)) (:f bindings (h/HMap Binding)) (:f defs (h/HMap String))\n  (:f types (h/HMap String)) (:f selfName (Option String)) (:f cls (Option String)) (:f nested Bool))\n\n(schema CallSite (:f rel String) (:f line Int64) (:f caller String) (:f callee String) (:f kind String) (:f via (Option String)) (:f through (Option String)))\n\n(schema Ref (:f rel String) (:f line Int64) (:f key String))\n\n(schema Dyn (:f rel String) (:f line Int64) (:f tag String) (:f base String))\n\n(schema Untyped (:f rel String) (:f line Int64) (:f attr String))\n\n(schema W\n  (:f calls (List CallSite)) (:f refs (List Ref)) (:f dynamic (List Dyn)) (:f untyped (List Untyped))\n  (:f varReads (h/HMap (List (Pair String Int64)))) (:f edges (h/HMap (h/HMap Bool))) (:f localsAt (h/HMap Bool)))\n\n(schema Ix\n  (:f mods (h/OMap PyMod)) (:f pkgs (h/HMap Bool)) (:f defs (h/OMap PyDef)) (:f attrTypes (h/HMap String))\n  (:f children (h/HMap (List String))) (:f lambdaKeys (h/HMap String)))\n\n(schema PyIndex (:f root String) (:f ix Ix) (:f w W) (:f unparsed (List String)) (:f warnings String))\n\n(enum Built\n  (:c built [(pi PyIndex)])\n  (:c pyAbsent [(why String)]))\n\nfn defKey m: String q: String -> String\n  (str m \"\\x01\" q)\n\nfn keyMod k: String -> String\n  (mt (stringIndexOf k \"\\x01\") ((some i) (optionOr (stringSlice k 0 i) \"\")) ((none) k))\n\nfn keyQual k: String -> String\n  (mt (stringIndexOf k \"\\x01\") ((some i) (optionOr (stringSlice k (+ i 1) (stringLength k)) \"\")) ((none) \"\"))\n\nfn lastDotIn s: String i: Int64 -> Int64\n  (cond ((< i 0) -1) ((= (optionOr (stringSlice s i (+ i 1)) \"\") \".\") i) (else (lastDotIn s (- i 1))))\n\nfn lastSeg q: String -> String\n  (let [(i (lastDotIn q (- (stringLength q) 1)))] (if (< i 0) q (optionOr (stringSlice q (+ i 1) (stringLength q)) \"\")))\n\nfn attrKey clsKey: String attr: String -> String\n  (str clsKey \"\\x02\" attr)\n\nfn lineKey rel: String line: Int64 -> String\n  (str rel \"\\x01\" (stringFromInt64 line))\n\nfn modOf ix: Ix name: String -> (Option PyMod)\n  (h/omGet ix.mods name)\n\nfn defOf ix: Ix key: String -> (Option PyDef)\n  (h/omGet ix.defs key)\n\nfn defKind ix: Ix key: String -> String\n  (mt (defOf ix key) ((some dd) dd.kind) ((none) \"\"))\n\nfn nameOf n: d/PyNode -> String\n  (optionOr (d/sfield n \"name\") \"\")\n\nfn idOf n: d/PyNode -> String\n  (optionOr (d/sfield n \"id\") \"\")\n\nfn endOf n: d/PyNode -> Int64\n  (if (> n.endLine 0) n.endLine n.line)\n\nfn defLike? t: String -> Bool\n  (or (= t \"FunctionDef\") (= t \"AsyncFunctionDef\") (= t \"ClassDef\"))\n\nfn stmtTypes -> (List String)\n  (list \"FunctionDef\" \"AsyncFunctionDef\" \"ClassDef\" \"Return\" \"Delete\" \"Assign\" \"TypeAlias\" \"AugAssign\" \"AnnAssign\" \"For\" \"AsyncFor\"\n        \"While\" \"If\" \"With\" \"AsyncWith\" \"Match\" \"Raise\" \"Try\" \"TryStar\" \"Assert\" \"Import\" \"ImportFrom\" \"Global\" \"Nonlocal\" \"Expr\" \"Pass\"\n        \"Break\" \"Continue\")\n\nfn pyPrefix s: String n: Int64 -> String\n  (let [(cs (c/charCodes s))]\n    (if (<= (listLength cs) n) s (mt (listGet cs n) ((some p) (optionOr (stringSlice s 0 (pairSecond p)) s)) ((none) s))))\n\nfn pyLen s: String -> Int64\n  (listLength (c/charCodes s))\n\nfn moduleName rel: String -> (Pair String Bool)\n  (let [(parts (stringSplit (optionOr (stringSlice rel 0 (- (stringLength rel) 3)) \"\") \"/\"))\n        (isPkg (= (optionOr (listLast parts) \"\") \"__init__\"))\n        (parts2 (if isPkg (listTake parts (- (listLength parts) 1)) parts))]\n    (pair (c/joinWith parts2 \".\") isPkg))\n\nfn rpartDot s: String -> String\n  (let [(i (lastDotIn s (- (stringLength s) 1)))] (if (< i 0) \"\" (optionOr (stringSlice s 0 i) \"\")))\n\nfn testFileName? rel: String -> Bool\n  (let [(base (c/baseName rel))]\n    (and (stringEndsWith? base \".py\")\n         (or (stringStartsWith? base \"test_\") (stringEndsWith? base \"_test.py\"))))\n\nfn testRel? rel: String -> Bool\n  (let [(parts (stringSplit rel \"/\"))]\n    (or (testFileName? rel) (listAny? (fn [(p String)] -> Bool (or (= p \"tests\") (= p \"test\"))) (listTake parts (- (listLength parts) 1)))))\n\nfn aliasName al: d/PyNode -> String\n  (optionOr (d/sfield al \"name\") \"\")\n\nfn importBindings pkg: String st: d/PyNode -> (List (Pair String Binding))\n  (cond\n    ((d/isType? st \"Import\")\n      (map (fn [(al d/PyNode)] -> (Pair String Binding)\n             (mt (d/sfield al \"asname\")\n               ((some a) (pair a (bMod (aliasName al) \"alias\")))\n               ((none) (let [(head (optionOr (listHead (stringSplit (aliasName al) \".\")) \"\"))] (pair head (bMod head \"dire